<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JDG" style="id">- Ndendeule Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Kitabo Cha Akakenga</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kitabo Cha Akakenga</para>
  <para style="toc2">Akakenga</para>
  <para style="toc3">Akak</para>
  <para style="mt">2 Kitabo Cha</para>
  <para style="mt1">Akakenga</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongolelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Kitabo chenje cha ilongoche bhibhakemitwa Akakenga ndi kitabo chikichimulila ghighakengima kipinde chela Akaichilahele pibhakijhingilila kilambo chuku Kaanane nu kutola kilambo chenie kubhehe chabhe. Kikibha kipinde cha malagho chikilongohina na mang'ahe nu kung'ahichwa, palonge ngibhaghombwika. Kipinde chenie Akaichilahele bhakayobhalila kuijhinamila ichapanga na peniya Chapanga ngabhahagwila bhando bha ilambo henge bhaike kwang'aha. Peniya bhando ngabhannelila nu kummujhii Chapanga na jwenio Chapanga ngabhahagwila ilongoche ikemitwa, “Akakenga,” kupala kwalongocha na kwabhoha bhando muubhanda na mu mang'ahe.</para>
  <para style="ip">Abhii jhe mundo jwaimanye achwa, kubhehe ghane jwakajhandike kitabo chenje cha Akakenga. Bhando bhamahele bhihambuka kubhehe pange jwakajhandike kitabo chenje akibha nnondole jwa Chapanga Chamwele, nambo ihoto kubhehe chakaka achwa kikajhandikwe kipinde chenie, Akaichilahele pibhakibha na munahota nkolongwa gwabhe, nhwalo kitabo chenje kilingukii unyuma nu kulonge kubhehe kipinde cha Akakenga, Akaichilahele bhakibha jhe na munahota nkolongwa, mu chula jha 17:6 na 18:1 na 19:1 ade mu chula jha 21:25. Kipinde chenie Akaichilahele ndi pibhabhokita ku Michile, ikibha mu chaka cha 1400 kabula jhukubhelukwa Yecho Kilichitu. Dolekeya mu longolelo gwa kitabo cha Kubhoka, na pange iwechekana indondo ya Akakenga ikatendike mu yaka ya 1300 ade 1050, kabula jhukubhelukwa Yecho Kilichitu, kipinde chenie Chaule ndi pajhemikwa kubhehe munahota nkolongwa jwa Akaichilahele.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ghughabhii mukitabo</para>
  <para style="io">Ngondo jha mwicho pakate jha Akaichilahela na Akakaane pala pajhomwika Yochuwa. Helahela ichimulila kipinde Chapanga pabhahagwila ilongoche bhibhalongwicha Akaichilahele na kwakombola, mu chula jha 1 ade 3:6.</para>
  <para style="io">Kabhele Chapanga ahaghuu Akakenga bhange kwatangatila Akaichilahele, mu chula jha 3:7 ade 16:31.</para>
  <para style="io">Kupeta kwa gheniya, Akaichilahele bhinneka Chapanga nu kuijhinamila ichapanga henge, mu chula jha 17 ade 21.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JDG 1" />
  <para style="s">Likabila lya Yuda na lya Chimeone bhimpukii munahota nkolongwa Adone bezeke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 1:1" />Pajhomwika Yochuwa, Akaichilahele ngabhankonyita Bhambo Chapanga kubhehe, “Ngohe likabila ghane lilipakutumbula kujhenda kwajhingilila Akakanaane?”<verse eid="JDG 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 1:2" />Bhambo Chapanga ngajhangwila, “Likabila lya Yuda ndi nalitumbula, nhwalo kilambo chenio kibhii mu kindendeke gwabhe.”<verse eid="JDG 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 1:3" />Bhando bha likabila lya Yuda ndi ngabhalobholila bhando bha likabila lya Chimeoene, “Tutangatane na twenga kukijhingilila kilambo chatupekii Chapanga mu kilambo cha Akakanaane. Na twe hele natuntangatila mangota.” <verse eid="JDG 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 1:4" />Bhahe, bhando bha likabila lya Yuda na Chimeone ngabhakijhingilila, na Bhambo Chapanga jwenio ngabhatangatila kwahotola Akakanaane na Akapeliche. Ngabhakomita bhando elufo kome kwenio ku Bezeke. <verse eid="JDG 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 1:5" />Ku muche gwenio ngabhankolila munahota nkolongwa Adone Bezeke, ngabhakomina nako na kwahotola Akakanaane na Akapeliche. <verse eid="JDG 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 1:6" />Munahota nkolongwa Adone Bezeke ngatilita, nambo Akaichilahele ngabhankengimila nu kukamula. Ngabhanhekita maghumba gha mulubhoko nu mulugholo. <verse eid="JDG 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 1:7" />Adone Bezeke palongila, “Chapanga anjwapwilwe kunhwalo, makacho nakakamwii akanahota akakolongwa chabine na kwaheketa maghumba gha mumabho na mumagholo nu kwachokolekeya bhalye imbolopolo ya pahe jha mecha jhango.” Yene ngabhampelika ku Yeluchalemo, ngawelila koko kwenio.<verse eid="JDG 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bhando bha likabila lya Yuda bhahoto bhando bhu ku Yeluchalemo nu ku Hebulone</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 1:8" />Peniya, bhando bha likabila lya Yuda ngabhaijhingilila Yeluchalamo nu kuipukila. Ngabhakomita bhando nu kuujhocha mwotu muche gwenio. <verse eid="JDG 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 1:9" />Pughajhomwikila gheniya, bhando bha likabila lya Yuda, ngabhajhenda kukomana na Akakaanane bhibhatamita mu ilambo ya itombe na mu ilambo yumu njenga ya kuchine na kilambo chandika upandi gwa kulitipikii lyobha. <verse eid="JDG 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 1:10" />Peniya, bhando bhuku Yuda ngabhajhenda kwajhingilila Akakaanane bhibhatamita ku muche gwaku Hebulone, kwa liina lenge ukemitwa Kilihate Aluba, kwenio ngabhaihotwila bhando bha ngolo ya Sheshai na Ahimane na Talumai.<verse eid="JDG 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Otiniele ahunhotola muche gwa Debele</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="JDG 15:13-19">Akakenga 15:13-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 1:11" />Bhahe, bhando bha likabila lya Yuda, ngabhajhenda kuujhingilila muche gwa Debele, makacho umanyikina Kilihate Sefele. <verse eid="JDG 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 1:12" />Peniya Kalebo palongila, “Jhojhoha jwapakujhingilila nu kuhotola muche gwaku Kilihate Sefele, nantolela nchikana gwango jwakemwa Akicha.” <verse eid="JDG 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 1:13" />Bhahe, Otiniele, mwana gwa Kenache unnung'una mundo Kalebo, ngabhaupukila muche gwenio, yene Kalebo ngantolikicha nchikana gwake Akicha. <verse eid="JDG 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 1:14" />Puupetita unyagho gwabhe gwa ndowa, Akicha ngannobholila Otiniele, annyope nkohano mundo Kalebo nng'onda. Akicha pahulwika tu muliponda, tate mundo ngankonyita, “Bho, nimpeke kilebhe ghane?” <verse eid="JDG 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 1:15" />Akicha ngannyangwila, “Mbala umbele hupo jhenge, umbekii njwe chehemo jhomo upande gwa kuchine.” Ngohe umbeke chehemo jhina ipela. Yene Kalebo ngampila chehemo jha ipela yuku ndumba na chehemo jha ipela ya pahe.<verse eid="JDG 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhotola kwa likabila lya Yuda na lya Benjamine</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 1:16" />Bhakenane, ndi bhibhakibha ibheluko ya nkohano mundo Mucha, ngabhalongihina na bhando bha likabila lya Yuda bhibhahumila ku muche gwa Mitende, kwa liina lenge ukemwa Yeliko, ngabhajhenda kutama pakate jha njenga jha Yuda upandi gwa kuchine, pahina na muche gwa Alade. <verse eid="JDG 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 1:17" />Peniya bhando bha likabila lya Yuda na Chimeone ngabhajhingilila Akakanaane bhibhatamita ku Zefati ngabhahotwila. Ngabhaukomilikiya njwe muche gwenio na kughalambula liina nu kubhehe Holima. <verse eid="JDG 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 1:18" />Helahela likabila lya Yuda ngabhaupukila muche gwa Gaza na chenda yake na Ashikelone na chenda yake na Ekilone na chenda yake. <verse eid="JDG 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 1:19" />Bhambo Chapanga ngabhatangatila bhando bha likabila lya Yuda, ngabhakipukila kilambo cha itombe. Nambo bhakahotwii jhe kwabhenga akolo kilambo bha pandika nhwalo bhakibha na chilaa yambone na mutuka yabhe ya ngondo iihutitwa na falache ikibha ya choma. <verse eid="JDG 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 1:20" />Muche gwa ku Hebulone ngabhampila Kalebo ngita chalaghila Mucha. Kalebo ndi jwabhengita ngolo itato ya Anake kwenio. <verse eid="JDG 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 1:21" />Nambo likabila lya Benjamine bhakabhengitii jhe Akayebuche bhibhatamita ku Yeluchalemo, ndi nhwalo Akayebuche bhitama pamonga na bhando bha likabila lya Benjamine ku Yeluchalemo ade ngohe.<verse eid="JDG 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Likabila lya Efulaimo na lya Manache bhaipukii Betele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 1:22" />Bhahe, bhando bha likabila lya Efulaimo na Manache ngabhajhingilila bhando bha muche gwa ku Betele, na Bhambo Chapanga ngabhatangatila. <verse eid="JDG 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 1:23" />Pibhatumita akalingukiya ku Betele, makacho umanyikina Luzu. <verse eid="JDG 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 1:24" />Akalingukiya bheniya, pibhalingukiya muche gwenio, ngapitila mundo na bhene ngabhannobholila, “Mutulangiye ndela jhakujhingila nkate jha muche na twenga natunkomajhe.” <verse eid="JDG 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 1:25" />Mundo jhola ngabhalangiya ndela jhakujhingilila na bhene ngabhakomita kila mundo umuche gwenio, nambo ngabhannekita ghome mundo jhola na akalongo mundo. <verse eid="JDG 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 1:26" />Mundo jhola ngatilila kukilambo cha Akahite, ngachenga muche gwake na ngaupila liina lya Luzu, ndi liina lyake ade ngohe.<verse eid="JDG 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Makabila ghangabhengwa na Akaichilahele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 1:27" />Nambo likabila lya Manache bhakabhengite jhe akolo muche bhuku Bete Shane na chenda yake na Tanake na chenda yake na Dole na chenda yake na Ibuleamo na chenda yake na Megido na chenda yake. Akakaanane ngabhajhendilila kutama kwenio. <verse eid="JDG 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 1:28" />Akaichilahele pibhajhonjekika nukubhehe na makakala, bhakabhengite jhe Akakaanane nambo ngabhachokolikiya kuhenga mahengo ngita akabhanda.<verse eid="JDG 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 1:29" />Helahela Akaefulaimo bhakabhengite jhe Akakaanane bhibhatamita ku Gezele ngabhajhendilila kutama pakate jhabhe.<verse eid="JDG 1:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 1:30" />Ata likabila lya Chabulone lyakabhengite jhe Akakaanane bhibhatamita ku Kitulone hilu bhibhatamita ku Nahalole, bhakajhendilii kutama pakate jhabhe nambo ngabhachokolikiya kuhenga mahengo ngita akabhanda.<verse eid="JDG 1:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 1:31" />Hilu likabila lya Ashele lyakabhengite jhe Akakaanane bhibhatamita ku Aka na ku Chidone na ku Alabo na bhuku Akichibo na bhuku Heluba na bhaku Afeka na bhu ku Lehobu. <verse eid="JDG 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 1:32" />Bhando bha likabila lya Ashele ngabhatamita pakate jha Akakaanane, nhwalo bhakabhengite jhe akolo kilambo chenio.<verse eid="JDG 1:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 1:33" />Helahela likabila lya Nafutale lyakabhengitii jhe akolo muche bha ku Bete Shemeshi hilu bhala Bete Anati, nambo Nafutale bhatamita panakate jhabhe. Akolo muche bheniya, ngabhachokolikilwa kwahenge mahengo Akaichilahele ngita akabhanda.<verse eid="JDG 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 1:34" />Akaamole ngabhabhengila bhando bha likabila lya Dane kwiitombe. Bhakalekitii jhe bhahelele mundika bhatame. <verse eid="JDG 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 1:35" />Akaamole ngabhajhendilila kutama mwiitombe ya Helesi na Aiyalone na Shalubimo, nambo bhando bha likabila lya Manache na Efulaimo pibhajhonjikika makakala nukubhehe twe ngabhahotwila na kwatenda Akaamole kuhenga mahengo ngita akabhanda.<verse eid="JDG 1:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 1:36" />Yene, mpaka gwa kilambo cha Akaamole kikibha upandi gwa kachikachine mwa Seile, chehemo jhukujhomboke pipakemwa kipyelele.<verse eid="JDG 1:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JDG 2" />
  <para style="s">Ntumiche jwa kunane kwa Bhambo Chapanga ilonge na Akaichilahele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 2:1" />Peniya, ntumiche jwa kunane jwa Bhambo Chapanga ngabhokita ku Geligale nu kujhenda ku Bokimo, nu ngabhapila ujumbe Akaichilahele jhilonge, “Nimoingine ku Michile nu kunneta mu kilambo channaghila akahoko bhino, nnongila kubhehe, ‘Nilitwekuu ng'o lilaghano lyango na mangota. <verse eid="JDG 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 2:2" />Mangota mangabheka jhe lilaghano na akolo kilambo, mipalwa mitilulana chehemo jhabhe jhukupiikiya litambiko jhichengwitwe.’ Nambo mangota mkannyeketii jhe. Nhwalo ghane nteila naha? <verse eid="JDG 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 2:3" />Ngohe ninnobholela kubhehe nabhenga jhe akolo kilambo bheniya nambo nabhabha akamakoko pakate jhino, na ichapanga yabhe naibhaha ntambo gwino.” <verse eid="JDG 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 2:4" />Ntumiche jwa kunane kwa Bhambo Chapanga pajhomolila kulonge naha kwa Akaichilahele, bhando ngabhalelita kukuchobhela. <verse eid="JDG 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 2:5" />Chehemo jhenie ngabhapakemita Bokimo yane kulela na bhene Akaichilahele ngabhampihikiya Bhambo Chapanga litambiko.<verse eid="JDG 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuwe kwa Yochuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 2:6" />Bhahe, Yochuwa ngabhatawika Akaichilahele, kila jhumo ngajhenda chehemo jhake jhalaghilwa kuibhujhila kubhehe pake. <verse eid="JDG 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 2:7" />Kipinde choha cha Yochuwa pakibha ghome, Akaichilahele ngabhantumikila Bhambo Chapanga. Na ata pajhomwika ngabhajhendelila kuntumikila Bhambo Chapanga machiko ghoha ghibhakibha ghome bhala ilongoche bhibhaighalila bhibhalolita ilebhe ikolongwa ya Chapanga yabhatendila Akaichilahela. <verse eid="JDG 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 2:8" />Yochuwa mwana jwa Nune na ntumiche jwa Bhambo Chapanga, ngajhomwika kongo abhii na yaka miya jhimo na likome limo. <verse eid="JDG 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 2:9" />Ngabhanchika mu chehemo jhabhaghulilwe kubhehe jhake kwenio ku Timunate helesi mu kilambo cha itombe ya Efulaimo kachikachine jha Gaashi. <verse eid="JDG 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 2:10" />Peniya, bhando bhoha bha kipinde cha Yochuwa ngakijhomwika nu kupitii bhando bhange bhangannyinamii Chapanga hilu ilebhe yabhatendila bhando bha Akaichilahele.<verse eid="JDG 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Akaichilahele bhileka kunnyinamila Bhambo Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 2:11" />“Peniya, Akaichilahele ngabhateila ilebhe ibhoho palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, ngabhaijhinamila ichapanga Baale. <verse eid="JDG 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 2:12" />Ngabhaleka kunnyinamila Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga jwa akahoko bhabhe jwabhabhoita mu kilambo chuku Michile. Ngabhaighalambukila ichapanga henge iyatindila ibhaijhinamila bhando bhibhatamita pahina jhabhe. Ngabhayomicha Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="JDG 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 2:13" />Ngannyinamila Baale na Maashitoleti nu kunneka kunnyinamila Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="JDG 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 2:14" />Yene, Bhambo Chapanga ngabhayomila Akaichilahele, ngabhateila bhando bhajhingilile na bhapoke ilebhe yabhe. Bhakibha jhe na makakala kabhele gha kukomana na akamakoko ghighatindila. <verse eid="JDG 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 2:15" />Popoha pibhajhawila kukomana ngabhalepalila nhwalo Bhambo Chapanga akatangatijhe, ngita hela chabhalobholila Bhambo Chapanga. Machiko ghoha ngabhabhila mu malagho hake.”<verse eid="JDG 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 2:16" />Ndi Bhambo Chapanga ngabhajhinula ilongoche bhibhakemitwa akakenga, ngabhakombwila kuhuma kwa akapoka bheniya bhibhajhingilila. <verse eid="JDG 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 2:17" />Nambo Akaichilahele bhakajhokanii jhe ata ilongoche bheniya, ngabhajhendilila na ngongola kwa kuikengama ichapanga henge nu kuijhinamila. Ngabhaghalambwika papa kwa kuileka ndela ibhateila akatate bhabhe jha kunnyinamii Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="JDG 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 2:18" />Kipinde choha Bhambo Chapanga pabhapelikila nkenga, jwenio Chapanga ngantangatila nkenga jwenio, ngabhakombwila mu ukindendeke gwa akamakoko bhabhe machiko ghoha pibhakibha ghome. Bhambo Chapanga ngabhabhonila kiya pajhohina kulela kwabhe nhwalo gwa mang'ahe nu kubhonelwa. <verse eid="JDG 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 2:19" />Nambo pajhomwika nkenga, bhando ngabhachochita kubhehe bhanganandela hake kupeta akahoko bhabhe. Ngabhantumikila ichapanga jhenge nu kuijhinamila. Ngabhakanita kuleka ndela jhabhe yanganandela hilu lighoho lyabhe. <verse eid="JDG 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 2:20" />Yene, Bhambo Chapanga ngachochita kwayome Akaichilahele nu kulonge, “Bhando bha kilambo chenje kitwekwii lilaghano lyamekita na akahoko bhabhe hilu bhijhokanikii jhe chinilonge, <verse eid="JDG 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 2:21" />niibhenga jhe kabhele bhando bha ilambo yenje yailekita Yochuwa kabula jha kujhomoka. <verse eid="JDG 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 2:22" />Naniitumila bhando bha ilambo yenio kwajhigha Akaichilahele kupala nole anda nabhantembekeya Bhambo Chapanga ngita chibhateila akahoko bhabhe.” <verse eid="JDG 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 2:23" />Bhahe, Bhambo Chapanga ngailekita bhando bha ilambo yenio, hilu Yochuwa akaibhekitii jhe mu kindendeke gwa Yochuwa.<verse eid="JDG 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JDG 3" />
  <para style="s">Bhando bha makabila ghange bhibhahighilike ku Kanaane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 3:1" />Bhamba ndi bhando bha ilambo yailekita Bhambo Chapanga kupala yajhighe Akaichilahele bhangakomana ngondo jhojhoha mukilambo cha Kanaane. <verse eid="JDG 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 3:2" />Ateila naha kupala kuibhola ibheluko ya Akaichilahele ngondo, achwa ibheluko yela yangakomana ngondo kuhumii makacho. <verse eid="JDG 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 3:3" />Bhamba ndi bhando bhabhalekita Bhambo Chapanga, akanahota akakolongwa nhwano bha Akafilichite na Akakanaane bhoha na Akachidone na Akahite bhibhatamita muitombe ya ku Lebanone kuhumii mukitombe chuku Baal Helumone ade Lebo Hamathe. <verse eid="JDG 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 3:4" />Bhalekitwa bhando bha ilambo yenio bhajhigwe kupala alole pange nabhatembekeya mihilo jha Bhambo Chapanga, yabhalaghila akahoko bhabhe kupete Mucha. <verse eid="JDG 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 3:5" />Akaichilahele ngabhatama panakate jha Akakaanane na Akahite na Akaamole na Akapeliche na Akayebuche. <verse eid="JDG 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 3:6" />Akaichilahele ngabhaitolikichina yana yabhe ikeghe na inalome na helahela bhijhinamila ichapanga yabhe.<verse eid="JDG 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Otiniele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 3:7" />Bhahe, Akaichilahele ngabhanyewita Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwabhe ngabhatenda ghanganandela na kuijhinamii inyagho ya Baale na Maashitole. <verse eid="JDG 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 3:8" />Bhahe, Bhambo Chapanga ngabhayomila hake Akaichilahele, nganteila munahota nkolongwa Kushane Lishataimo jwaku Mesopotaniya bhabule na bheniya ngabhantumikila kwa kipinde cha yaka nane. <verse eid="JDG 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 3:9" />Peniya Akaichilahele pibhannelila Bhambo Chapanga, Bhambo Chapanga ngahaghulilwa Otiniele mwana jwa Kenaze unnung'una mundo Kelebo kubhehe nkombola. <verse eid="JDG 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 3:10" />Uhuke gwa Bhambo Chapanga ngaikila Otiniele, yene ngabhila kilongoche jwa Akaichilahele. Peniya, ngajhenda kukomana ngondo na munahota nkolongwa Kushane Lishataimo jwa ku Mesopotaniya na Bhambo Chapanga ngantangatila Otiniele kunhotola Kushane. <verse eid="JDG 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 3:11" />Yene kilambo ngakibhila teeke kwa yaka makome ncheche. Peniya Otiniele mwana jwa Kenaze, ngajhomwika.<verse eid="JDG 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ehude</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 3:12" />Bhahe, Akaichilahele ngabhatumbwla kabhele kuntembekeya Bhambo Chapanga kukutenda uhakaho, yenio Bhambo Chapanga ngabhatenda bhalepelele na munahota nkolongwa Elugone jwa ku Moabo kupala bhahotole Akaichilahele. <verse eid="JDG 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 3:13" />Munahota nkolongwa Elugone ngabhatoila Akaamole na Akaamaleke pamonga, ngabhajhenda kukomana na Akaichilahele, ngabhahotwila. Ngabhaupukila muche gwa mikongo jha Mitende, liina lenge ukemitwa Yeliko. <verse eid="JDG 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 3:14" />Munahota nkolongwa Egulone jwaku Moabo ngabhantumikila Akaichilahele kwa kipinde cha yaka kome na nane.<verse eid="JDG 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 3:15" />Peniya Akaichilahele ngabhannelila kabhele Bhambo Chapanga, jwenie ngabhapila nkombola Ehude mwana jwa Gela jwatumii lubhoko lwa ngejha jwa likabila lya Benjamine. Akaichilahele ngabhantumila munahota nkolongwa Elugone jwaku Moabo, apeleke hupo yabhe. <verse eid="JDG 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 3:16" />Ehude ngakitengenichila upanga ghutema kone na kone, kutandamala kwake chentimita amuchine, ngalibhilingilila lijambiya lyenio mulubhoko lwake lyulelo. <verse eid="JDG 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 3:17" />Peniya, ngampelikila Elugone munahota nkolongwa hupo yela. Jwenio Elugone akibha nkendaho hake. <verse eid="JDG 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 3:18" />Ehude pajhomolila kupiya hupo, ngabhalobholila bhando bhibhagheghita hupo bhala bhakelebhuke kajha. <verse eid="JDG 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 3:19" />Nambo Ehude paikita painyagho yukubhachwa ya maghanga pahina na ku Geligale, ndi ngabhujhita kwa Elugone nu kulonge, “Mwe munahota, mbala kunpwepwe nhwalo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 3:19">Munahota nkolongwa ngabhalaghalikiya akatumiche bhake, “Mpite panja!” Na bhena akatumiche, ngabhapita panja.<verse eid="JDG 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 3:20" />Bhahe, Ehude nganheghilila pakatamite muchumbe chukugholofa chikipepete malile kipinde cha kilangache nu kunobholela, “Mmii nu lupwepo kubhoka kwa Chapanga.” Munahota nkolongwa jhola ngajhemita. <verse eid="JDG 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 3:21" />Ehude ngahulumwila upanga kwa lubhoko lwake lwangejha kubhoka mulibhondo lyalelo, nganhochita mulutumbo lwa Elugone, munahota nkolongwa. <verse eid="JDG 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 3:22" />Lijambiya ngalijhingiya na kipitika chake pwete, ngaupitila kuyeto kung'ongo. Ehude ngaulumwila na mahuta ngaghajhengilila mu lijambiya lyenio. <verse eid="JDG 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 3:23" />Peniya Ehude ngapita panja, ngadinda milyango jha chumbe chenio kwa pungolo. <verse eid="JDG 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 3:24" />Ehude pabhokita, akatumiche bhake munahota nkolongwa ngabhahika nu kukole milyango jha chumbe idinditwe kwa pungolo, ngabhalongila, “Pange abhii kucholo.” <verse eid="JDG 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 3:25" />Bhahe, ngabhalendila ade ngabhabhila na kiholo. Milyango adindu jhe, ngabhatola upungulo kujhoghola. Dola ngabhankole munahota gwabhe abhii ngula, ajhomwike.<verse eid="JDG 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 3:26" />Pibhannendelila pala, Ehude nganyogholwika. Na paikita piinyagho yamaghanga, nganyogholwikila ku Seira. <verse eid="JDG 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 3:27" />Pahikita kwenio, ngahonita lipenenga mu kilambo cha itombe ya ku Efulaimo, Akaichilahele ngabhahelila pamonga na jwenio kongo jwenio abhalongwicha. <verse eid="JDG 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 3:28" />Ngalongila, “Ungengame nenga, nhwalo Bhambo Chapanga andangatile kwahotola akamakoko bhino Akamoabo.” Kuyene Akaichilahele ngabhankengima Ehude ade palyomboko lya Yoludane nu kukipukila chibhajhombwika Akamoabo, ngabhaibhila mundo jhojhoha angajhomboka jhe. <verse eid="JDG 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 3:29" />Kipinde chenio ngabhakomita akakomana ngondo elufo kome bhibhakibha na makakala na bhangajhoghopa, abhii jhe ata jhumo jwakanyogholwike. <verse eid="JDG 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 3:30" />Lichiko lyenio, Akaichilahele ngabhahotwila Akamoabo. Yene kilambo ngakibhila teeke kwa kipinde yaka kome na nane.<verse eid="JDG 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shamugale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 3:31" />Pajhomolila Ehude, mwana jwa Anate, ngahika Shamugale ngatola pwache jhake. Jwenio ngabhakoma Akafilichite miya chita kwa luyato lulunyenyike. Hele ngabhakombwila Akaichilahele.<verse eid="JDG 3:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JDG 4" />
  <para style="s">Debola na Balake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 4:1" />Pajhomwika Ehude, Akaichilahele ngabhateila kabhele uhakaho gwabhe Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="JDG 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 4:2" />Yene, Bhambo Chapanga ngantangatila munahota nkolongwa Yabine jwaku Kanaane, jwalongicha ku Hazole. Nkolo jwa akakomana ngondo akemitwa Sisela, jwatamita kwenio ku Haloshete Hagoyimo. <verse eid="JDG 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 4:3" />Munahota nkolongwa Yabine akibha na mutuka ya choma miya ticha ghighahutwa na falache. Jwenio Yabine helahela akang'ahite hake Akaichilahele kwa kipinde cha yaka makome mabhele. Peniya, Akaichilahele ngabhannelila Bhambo Chapanga abhatangatile.<verse eid="JDG 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 4:4" />Kipinde chenio pakibha na nnondole jwa Chapanga mwikeghe liina lyake Debola, nhwanamundo Lepidote, kipinde chenio Lepidote akibha nkenga jwa Akaichilahele. <verse eid="JDG 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 4:5" />Debola akibha ajhawila kutama pahe jha nkongo ntende ghukibha panakate jha muche gwa ku Rama na ku Betele, mu kilambo cha itombe yaku Efulaimo. Akaichilahele bhakanyendii kupala atemulane mihalo jhabhe. <verse eid="JDG 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 4:6" />Lichiko limo ngankema Balake mwana jwa Abinoamo jwa ku Kadeche, kwenio ku Nafutale nu kunnobholela, “Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga jwa Akaichilahele, anaghalikiya naha, ‘Nnyende, makatole akanalome elufo kome kubhoka ku Nafutale na ku Chabulone mwalongoche mu kitombe Tabore. <verse eid="JDG 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 4:7" />Naninnobholela Sisela, nkolo jwa akakomana ngondo jwa Yabine pamonga na mutuka yake ya ngondo ade mu lukemba Kishone, namwenga nanintangatila kunhotola.’ ”<verse eid="JDG 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 4:8" />Balake ngannobholila Debola, “Anda natulongohana, nanyenda. Nambo anda tulongahana jhe, nijhenda ndeka.”<verse eid="JDG 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 4:9" />Debola ngajhangwila, “Chakaka natulongohana pamonga nambo ndela jhipetela nampata ndeka ichima nhwalo Bhambo Chapanga nantangatila mwikeghe anhotole Sisela.” Bhahe, Debola ngalongohina na Balake ade ku Kadeshe, <verse eid="JDG 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 4:10" />kwenio Balake ngabhakonganicha akakomana ngondo kuhuma mu makabila gha Chabulone na Nafutale. Bhando elufo kome ngabhankengima Balake, na Debola ngabhalongohina pamonga.<verse eid="JDG 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 4:11" />Kipinde chenio Heberi, jhumo jwa lukolo lwa Hobabo, nnamo mundo Mucha. Ngabhaleka Akakene ajhake nu kutama nganjika. Ngabheka kighono chake kutale kwenio ku mwalone gwa ku Zaananimo, pahina naku Kadeche.<verse eid="JDG 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 4:12" />Sisela pajhohina kubhehe Balake mwana jwa Abinoamo ajhawii ku itombe ya Tabore, <verse eid="JDG 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 4:13" />Sisela ngakonganicha akakomana ngondo na mutuka yake miya ticha ya choma ya ngondo yukuhutwa na falache, ngabhoka ku Haloshete Hagoimo, nu kujhenda ade ku lukemba Kishone.<verse eid="JDG 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 4:14" />Debola ngannobholila Balake, “Jhenda! Deleno ndi lichiko lino lyukunhotola Sisela! Nhwalo Bhambo Chapanga nantangatila mwenga mahotole bheniya. Chakaka Chapanga abhii nnonge jhino kunkomanila.” Yene, Balake ngahelila ku itombe Tabore na akakomana ngondo elufo kome. <verse eid="JDG 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 4:15" />Bhambo Chapanga ngammoghina Sesila na bhajhendecha mutuka na akakomana ngondo bhoha kwa upanga nnonge jha Balake, yene Sisela ngaileka mutuka jhake nu kutila kwa magholo. <verse eid="JDG 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 4:16" />Bhahe, Balake ngabhabhutwiya akakomana ngondo bheniya na mutuka ya choma ya ngondo ade ku Haloshete Hagoimo na kwakoma akakomana ngondo bhoha ku upanga, akahighii jhe hilu jhumo.<verse eid="JDG 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 4:17" />Nambo Sisela ngabhutikila mu lihema lya Yaele, nhwana mundo Hebere, lukolo lwa Nkene nhwalo bhajhilanila kwa ukoche pakate jha Yabine, munahota nkolongwa jwa ku Hazore nu lukolo lwa Hebere, Nkene. <verse eid="JDG 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 4:18" />Yaele ngaika nu kukumbatila Sisela nu kunnobholela, “Munahota, jhingila nkate.” Peniya, Sisela ngajhingila nkate mwa Yaele, na jwenie Yaele ngampukita libulangete gubigubi. <verse eid="JDG 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 4:19" />Sisela ngannobholila Yaele, “Mmii na nyota, umbe mache.” Yaele ngampila mabhele badajha mache, peniya ngampukita kabhele. <verse eid="JDG 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 4:20" />Peniya, Sisela ngannobholila nhwanamundo Hebere, “Jhema pannyango. Mundo jhojhoha jwapakukonya abhii nng'ene jhojhoha pamba, nnongela, abhii jhe.”<verse eid="JDG 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 4:21" />Sisela akibha tipitipi mulughono ku kutotokela. Yene Yaele, nhwana jwa Hebere, ngatoila kipekepeke cha lihema na nyundo, nganyalila kachoko ngankobholila palibhonge lya muto ngakipitila kukihogho nu kujhingii muundope. Yene, Sisela ngajhomwikila papa. <verse eid="JDG 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 4:22" />Balake pibhankengimila Sisela, Yaele ngapita panja nu kumpokela. Ngannobholila, “Hika! Ninangiye jhola jhumumpalaha.” Balake ngajhingila nkate jha lihema lya Yaele nu kunkolela Sisela abhii ngula ajhomwike, na kipekepeke cha lihema kibhii pakibhonge chake.<verse eid="JDG 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 4:23" />Yene lichiko lyenie, Chapanga ngabhatangatila Akaichilahele kunhotola munahota nkolongwa Yabine jwa Akakanaane. <verse eid="JDG 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 4:24" />Akaichilahele ngabhajhendilila kubhehe na makakala hake kumpeta munahota nkolongwa Yabine, ade pibhankomilikiya njwenjwe.<verse eid="JDG 4:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JDG 5" />
  <para style="s">Nhwambo gwa Debola na Balake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 5:1" />Lichiko lyene, Debola na Balake mwana gwa Abinoamo ngabhajhemba nhwambo ghongo.<verse eid="JDG 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 5:2" />Ilongoche bha bhando bha Akaichilahele ngabhalongwicha bhando kujhenda kungondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:2">bhando ngabhahikita changakangwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:2">Tunnomba mwe ma Bhambo Chapanga!<verse eid="JDG 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 5:3" />Jhokanikiya ma akanahota nkolongwa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:3">Jhokanikiya ilongoche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:3">Naninyembela Bhambo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:3">Chapanga jwa Akaichilahele.<verse eid="JDG 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 5:4" />Ma Bhambo Chapanga, pummokita kwenio kukitombe cha Seire,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:4">Punhelila kuitombe ya Edomo, kilambo ngakilendima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:4">ula ngaikomita.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:4">ena, mahunde ngaghaletita ula.<verse eid="JDG 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 5:5" />Itombe ngainyukwinyika palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:5">Ena, ata kitombe chela cha Chinae palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga.<verse eid="JDG 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 5:6" />Mu machiko gha Shamugale mwana jwa Anate,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:6">ngohe machiko gha Yaele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:6">mwanja jhukuchucha ilekwitwe mu ilambo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:6">Bhando bhibhabhii umwanja ngabhabhetukila mu upele.<verse eid="JDG 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 5:7" />Akolo muche ngabhalekita kulema mu mighonda jhabhe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:7">ade pumbitila ne na Debola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:7">puhikita kubhehe nalinyongolo lya ku Ichilahele.<verse eid="JDG 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 5:8" />Ngibhaijhinamila ichapanga ya kighene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:8">ngaipitila ngondo mu kilambo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:8">Nambo bhakibha jhe nu mundo jhuna ngao hilu nkoha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:8">pakate jha bhando elufo alobaine bhaku Ichilahele!<verse eid="JDG 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 5:9" />Nape ichima ilongoche ya ku Ichilahele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:9">pamonga na bhala bhibhaikita bhene changakangwa pakate jha bhando,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:9">munnombe Bhambo Chapanga!<verse eid="JDG 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 5:10" />Kila jhumo ajhokanikiye, mwe bhimihobhoke maponda mahuo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:10">unyokanikiya mangota mina ilembwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:10">bhimitama mu mipacha jha bei ngolongwa jhimitamii mu maponda gheniya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:10">mangota bhimityanga undela unyokanikiye.<verse eid="JDG 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 5:11" />Jhokanikiya malobhe bhibhajhemba bhibhabhii pahina na ilibha ya mache.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:11">Bhichimulila ilebhe ikolongwa yateii Bhambo Chapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:11">bhilonge namuna jha akakomana ngondo bha Akaichilahele chibhanhotwila akamakoko bhabhe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:11">peniya, bhando bha Chapanga ngabhajhenda mu milyango jha muche.<verse eid="JDG 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 5:12" />“Jhimuka Debola!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:12">Jhimuka nnyembe nhwambo!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:12">Jhimuka Balake mwana gwa Abinoamo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:12">bhatole bhando bhino bhimapukile.”<verse eid="JDG 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 5:13" />Bhando bhibhahobholeka ngibhabhujha ku ilongoche yabhe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:13">Bhando bha Chapanga ngabhammujhila kupala kukomana na akamakoko bhabhe.<verse eid="JDG 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 5:14" />Ku Efulaimo ngabhaika akakomana ngondo lya Akameleke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:14">Benjamine abhii pakate jhabhe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:14">kubhoka ku Makile ngabhaulwika ilongoche ikolongwa ya akakomana ngondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:14">na ku Chabulone ngabhaika akatumiche ikolongwa.<verse eid="JDG 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 5:15" />Akanahota bhuku Ichakale bhakibha pamo na Debola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:15">ena, Ichakale akibha pamo na Balake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:15">ngabhamtukila mbilo ade kululambo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:15">nambo likabila lya Leubene bhateila kuholelaholela hake.<verse eid="JDG 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 5:16" />Kilebhe ghane ntamita unyuma mu ibhajha ya mambelele?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:16">Bho, kujhokanikiya malobhe gha bhibhalucha bhakemita mambelele?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:16">Ena bhando bha likabila lya Leubene ngabhapechangina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:16">bhateila kuholelaholela kujhenda amu.<verse eid="JDG 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 5:17" />Bhando bha likabila lya Geliade likatamite kwiye jha lukemba Yoludane.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:17">Kilebhe ghane bhando bha likabila lya Dane liighalike mu mele?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:17">Na bhando bha likabila lya Ashele bhakibha nuu muupele jha mbwane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:17">ntamingine tu muupele jha bandale.<verse eid="JDG 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 5:18" />Bhando bha likabila lya Chabulone na Nafutale, ngabhajheketila bhene ata kuhwe ku ngondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:18">ata mumipaka jha mighonda.<verse eid="JDG 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 5:19" />Kwenio ku Taanake, muupele jha chembwe cha Megido,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:19">akanahota akakolongwa ngabhaika kukomana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:19">na akanahota akakolongwa bhaku Kaanane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:19">nambo bhakatoi jhe kilebhe chochoha madine gha feza.<verse eid="JDG 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 5:20" />Ngita hela ndondo yukunane kwa Chapanga itukomanila kunhwalo gwito,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:20">ngita ndondo ipetita panane jhito kukomana na Sisela,<verse eid="JDG 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 5:21" />lukemba Kishone ngalwajhola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:21">nhwalo maheluko gha mache twe gha Kishone.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:21">Lola lukemba lwa makacho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:21">lukemba Kishone,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:21">ena, nanyenda nnonge kwa makakala!<verse eid="JDG 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 5:22" />Kwa nhindo gwa ipagha ya falache ngaitimbita,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:22">falache yake ghina makakala pighabhutuka kuhumii kungondo.<verse eid="JDG 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 5:23" />Ntumiche jwa kunane kwa Chapanga ilonge naha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:23">“Mujhopela ghanganandela muche gwa Meloze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:23">mangatenda ubhiche jhe pimajhope ghanganandela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:23">nhwalo bhankantangatii jhe Bhambo Chapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:23">kinyume cha bhina makakala.”<verse eid="JDG 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 5:24" />Nambo Yaele nhwanamundo Hebere Nkene, ndi jwapakubhe niichima hake akakeghe bhoha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:24">abhii niichima kupeta akakeghe bhoha bhibhatama mu mahema.<verse eid="JDG 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 5:25" />Sisela akannyopite mache, nambo ngampila mabhele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:25">ngampila siaghe mubakule jha ichima.<verse eid="JDG 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 5:26" />Kwa lubhoko lumo ngakamwila kipekepeke cha lihema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:26">na lubhoko lwalelo akibha na nyundo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:26">ngankong'ondila Sisela palibhonge ngo nu ngahanjulina menyemenye.<verse eid="JDG 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 5:27" />Sisela ngalitita, ngagwila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:27">ngagholwika nuu pamagholo ghake.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:27">Peniya pajhinima ndi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:27">akibha ajhomwike!<verse eid="JDG 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 5:28" />“Majhe gwa Sisela ngalingulila palidilicha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:28">kupete palidilicha ngalelita, alongila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:28">‘Kilebhe ghane mutuka jhake ikibha na kiyoto kuika?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:28">Nhwalo ghane ihindo ya mutuka yake ijhokanikike jhe?’<verse eid="JDG 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 5:29" />Ngabhanyangwila akakeghe bhina malango,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:29">ngalitulila pipipi kwa lijhangulilo lyenio.<verse eid="JDG 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 5:30" />‘Pange bhipalaha ilebhe yukupukila nu kughabhana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:30">kamwale jhumo amu bhabhele kwa kila nkomana ngondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:30">ligwanda lya mangoma gha limbelele kwa nhwalo jha Sisela.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:30">Magwanda ghighalembelekwii kwa nyuche twe na mikufo kunhwalo jha ntandala gwango!’<verse eid="JDG 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 5:31" />Mwe ma Bhambo Chapanga, akamakoko bhino bhoha bhapulutuka puu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:31">Nambo akakoche bhino bhabha ngita lyobha lyu nhwana, pulihembuka kwa makakala.”</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JDG 5:31" />
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 5:31">Peniya, kilambo ngakibhila teeke kwa kipinde cha yaka makome ncheche.<verse eid="JDG 5:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JDG 6" />
  <para style="s">Gidione abhe kilongoche</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 6:1" />Akaichilahele kabhele ngabhajhendilila kutenda ghanganandela palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, yene Bhambo Chapanga ngabhalekita bhang'ahichwe na bhando bhuku Midiane kwa yaka chaba. <verse eid="JDG 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 6:2" />Akamidiane ngabhang'ahicha hake Akaichilahele, bhahe, Akaichilahele ngabhatilila kwiitombe nu kujhobha mu mikwembe. <verse eid="JDG 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 6:3" />Pipipi aka Ichilahele pibhapandita mbejho yabhe, akakomana ngondo bha aka Midiane na Akameleke na bhange bhando kuhumii kulihumii lyobha ngabhakijhingilila kilambo chabhe. <verse eid="JDG 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 6:4" />Akakomana ngondo bheniya ngabhabhekita kighono pahina na kilambo chenio nu kwajhingilila. Ngabhahangabhina kila kilebhe mu kilambo chenio ade pahina nu ku Gacha, ngabhakomita mambelele na ng'ombi na maponda. <verse eid="JDG 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 6:5" />Bhahe, akamakoko bhakibha bhahikita kila chaka, bhakibhana ipugho na lihema yabhe ngita nchambe gwa madidima. Ikibha chepa kwabhalanga bhando na ngamiya yabhe, ngabhakijhingilila kilambo kukihangabhana. <verse eid="JDG 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 6:6" />Akaichilahele bhakibha manga makakala na akahocho kwa Akamidane, yene Akaichilahele ngabhanelila Bhambo Chapanga kupala kwatangatila.<verse eid="JDG 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 6:7" />Akaichilahele pibhannelila Chapanga kupala ammokeya mang'ahe ku nhwalo gwa aka Midiane, <verse eid="JDG 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 6:8" />Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga jwaku Ichilahele, ngantumita nnondole jwa Chapanga ngabhalobholila, “Nimmohite mangota kukilambo chumikibha kubhanda ku Michile. <verse eid="JDG 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 6:9" />Nganinkombwila mu mabhoko gha aka Michile bhoha bhibhang'ahita. Nganabhengita kutale bhando bheniya nu kumpela mangota kilambo chabhe. <verse eid="JDG 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 6:10" />Peniya, nganinnobholila kubhehe, ‘Ne ndi Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino mangaijhinamii jhe ichapanga ya Akaamole, ngohe kilambo chabhe mitama. Nambo makajhokanikii jhe lilobhe lyango.’ ”<verse eid="JDG 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 6:11" />Ntumiche jwa kunane kwa Bhambo Chapanga ngaika nu kutama pahe jha nkongo nkolongwa ghukemwa mwalone kwenio ku Ofula, nkongo gwenio ukibha gwa Yoashi mundo jwa lukolo lwa Abiezele. Na Gidione akibha ajhembiluya ngano mu kilibha chukuminyii chabibo kukukihiya Akamidiane bhangammona jhe. <verse eid="JDG 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 6:12" />Yene, ntumiche jwa Bhambo jwa kunane kwa Chapanga ngampitila Gidione nu kunnobholela, “Bhambo abhii na mwenga, mangajhoghopa jhe!”<verse eid="JDG 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 6:13" />Gidione ngajhanyangwila, “Anda chakaka Bhambo abhii na twenga, ghanga ghahumii koke? Ibhii koke itendwa yake ikolo ibhatuchimulila akatate bhito pibhalongila, atubhohite ku Michile? Nambo ngohe Bhambo Chapanga atulekite aka Midiane bhatung'ahe.”<verse eid="JDG 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 6:14" />Bhahe, Bhambo Chapanga jwene ngang'alambwika nu kunaghalikiya Gidione, “Kwa makakala ghanga, nnyende makakombole aka Ichilahele kubhoka kwa aka Midiane.”<verse eid="JDG 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 6:15" />Gidione ngajhangwila, “Bhambo Chapanga bhango, bho, nanakombola bhole aka Ichilahele? Lukolo lwango luleghelike hake na akahocho mu likabila lya Manache, nenga ndi kilebhe nacho kwa akalongo bhango.”<verse eid="JDG 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 6:16" />Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila, “Namma pamonga na mwenga kuntangatila. Namakomelekeya aka Midiane ambuka lipepetai, ngita mundo jhumo.”<verse eid="JDG 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 6:17" />Gidione ngannyangwila, “Anda chakaka yenio, bhahe, nnangiye nginyililo kubhehe mwe ndi ma Bhambo Chapanga jhumilonge na nenga. <verse eid="JDG 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 6:18" />Mangaheghe jhe pamba, ade pumbakubhujha nu kunnete litambiko lyango.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 6:18">Bhambo Chapanga nganyangwila, “Naninendela ade pumpa kuhika.”<verse eid="JDG 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 6:19" />Gidione ngabhujhita kajhake, ngalenganikiya litohe lya mbuhe na mabumunda ghangaleke ngedule kubhoka mu kibhegha cha ukobha, ngatoila nyama nukubheka mukikapo na mito mukibhegha ngannetila Bhambo Chapanga, ngabhekita pahe jha nkongo gwa mwalone. <verse eid="JDG 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 6:20" />Ntumiche jwa Bhambo jwa kunane kwa Chapanga ngannobholila, “Ntole nyama na mabumunda ghangaleke ngedule mmeke palindalabho lende na mito nnyitilila nyama na mabumunda.” Gidione ngateila ngita chalaghalikilwe. <verse eid="JDG 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 6:21" />Yene, ntumiche jwa Bhambo jwa kunane kwa Chapanga ngapapiya nyama na mabumunda ghenio kwa nkongocho gwenio. Papa mwotu ngupitila mu lindalabho lyenio, ngautiniya nyama na mabumunda na peniya ntumiche jwenio ngahobhalila.<verse eid="JDG 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 6:22" />Peniya, Gidione ndi pamanyita kubhehe jwenio akibha ntumiche jwa Bhambo Chapanga jwa kunane kwa Chapanga, ngalonge, “Nanola choto namwene, mwe Bhambo Chapanga, nhwalo nimwene ntumiche gwino kwa miho ghango namwete.”<verse eid="JDG 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 6:23" />Nambo Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila, “Uteeke ubhaha na mwenga. Mangapwelela jhe, chakaka miwe jhe.” <verse eid="JDG 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 6:24" />Bhahe, Gideone nganchengila Bhambo Chapanga chehemo jha kupiya litambiko kwenio na ngaikemita Yehova Shalomu yane, “Bhambo Chapanga ndi jhu uteeke.” Chehemo jhene jha kupiya litambiko ibhii kwenio ku Ofula, ku muche gwa lukolo lwa Akabiezele, ade deleno.<verse eid="JDG 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 6:25" />Kilo jhejhe Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Gidione, “Ntole ng'ombi nkambako jwa tate gwino, na ng'ombi jhonge jwabhii na yaka chaba. Na peniya ntilulane chehemo jha kupiya litambiko jhichengwitwe na Baale yaijhinamila tate gwino nkajhulane inyagho yoha ya Ashela ibhii pahina jhino. <verse eid="JDG 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 6:26" />Peniya ntola maghanga unjengela nenga Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, chehemo jhukupiikiya matambiko jhambone chehemo jhenje pipajhinwike. Peniya umbihikiya litambiko lyu kukomelekeya lya lipongo lela kongo hanjo ibhaha kinyagho cha Ashela.” <verse eid="JDG 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 6:27" />Bhahe, Gidione ngatoila akatumiche bhake kome, ngateila ngita chalobholilwe na Bhambo Chapanga. Nambo ajhogwipa akalongo mundo na bhando bhubhabhii kubomane apata atende muhe nambo jwenio ngateila kilo.<verse eid="JDG 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 6:28" />Akolo muche pibhajhimuka putepute, ngabhaibhona chehemo jhukupiikiya matambiko jha Baale na kinyagho cha Ashela kikibha pahina jhake kitilulinwe. Lipongo jwa ubhele jwakakomilikilwe chehemo jhukupiikiya matambiko jhikibha ichengwitwe chehemo jhenio. <verse eid="JDG 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 6:29" />Bhene ngabhakonyina, “Meneke jwatei naha?” Pibhalingukiya ngabhamanya kubhehe Gidione mwana jwa Yoashi ndi jwatei gheniya. <verse eid="JDG 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 6:30" />Akolo muche bheniya ngabhannobholila Yoashi kubhehe, “Tumpala mwana gwino tunkome, nhwalo atiluline maghanga gha chehemo jhukupiikiya matambiko jha Baale na kukajhulana kinyagho cha Ashela kikibha pahina jhake.”<verse eid="JDG 6:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 6:31" />Nambo Yoashi ngaulobholila nchambe ghola, “Bho, mangota mkengelela Baale? Bho, mangota namkoombola? Mundo jhojhoha jwapakunkengelela nakomwa uhiko ghongoneghone. Anda chakaka Baale ndi Chapanga, bhahe, akikengelela jwene, nhwalo chehemo jha kupiikiya matambiko ghake, ipondomwike.” <verse eid="JDG 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 6:32" />Lichiko lyenio bhando ngabhankema Gidione Yelubaale, nhwalo, “Baale akikengelela jwenio, nhwalo Gideone ahipondomwile chehemo jhake jhukupiikiya matambiko pa ichapanga Baale.”<verse eid="JDG 6:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 6:33" />Bhahe, Akamidiane na Wamaleke na makabila ghange ghuupande ghulihumii lyobha ngabhajheketilana kujhenda kungondo pamonga. Ngabhajhomwika kwiye jha lukemba Yoludane nu kubheka ighono yabhe mululambo lwaku Yezileele. <verse eid="JDG 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 6:34" />Nambo uhuke gwa Chapanga nganhikila Gidione, nganhonita lipenenga kwakema bhando bhu lukolo lwa Akabiezele bhankengame. <verse eid="JDG 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 6:35" />Ngatuma bhando bhajhende mu kilambo cha Akamanache kwakema. Na bhange bhando ngabhatumita kwakema bhando bha likabila lya Ashele na Akachabulone na Akanafutale, bhoha ngabhaika kukongana nabho.<verse eid="JDG 6:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 6:36" />Peniya, Gidione ngannobholila Chapanga, “Anda chaka naundumila, kwakombola Ichilahele kupete nenga, <verse eid="JDG 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 6:37" />ngohe nibheka limbendela lya limbelele pakupulukiya ngano. Anda napabhaha na mangame palimbendela tu, na pahe patepetii jhe, namanya kubhehe mwenga namaghombola Akaichilahele kupete nenga ngita chinnalaghila.” <verse eid="JDG 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 6:38" />Yene ndi chitendika, Gidione pajhimwika lukela, ngambukwita mangame ghighatepitii limbendela, ngatweliya mu bakule. <verse eid="JDG 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 6:39" />Peniya, Gidione ngannobholila Bhambo Chapanga, “Chonde Bhambo mangayome jhe, nambo nyopa nnonge lilobhe lende, uneke ndumii limbendela lende kwa lenge lijhighinikilo. Limbendela lende lyangatepete jhe, nambo pahe pabhaha na mangame twe. <verse eid="JDG 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 6:40" />Chapanga ngateila yenio uhiko gwenio, limbendela ndo likibha lijhomo nambo nnema ghoha ukibha chwii mangame.”<verse eid="JDG 6:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JDG 7" />
  <para style="s">Gidione abhahoto Akamidiane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 7:1" />Lichiko limo Yerubaale yane, Gidione na akakomana ngondo bhake bhoha ngabhajhimuka putepute nu kubheka kighono pahina na chembwe cha mache chuku Halode. Kighono cha Akamidiane kikibha upande gwa kachikachine pahina na mu lulambo pahina ni kitombe chuku Mole.<verse eid="JDG 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 7:2" />Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Gidione, “Akakomana ngondo bhumii nako bhajholwike hake ku kwahoto aka Midiane. Mwichilahele angakikweya jhe kubhehe, makakala ghake jwenio kulonge ndi ghankombwii. <verse eid="JDG 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 7:3" />Ngohe matangachila bhando kubhehe, ‘Mundo jhojhoha jwajhoghopa nu kulendema chonde mbaha akalebhuka ukajha, abhoke pakitombe cha Gileade.’ ” Yene bhando elufo ichiline na mabhele ngabhakelebhuka na ngabhaighala bhando elufo kome ndo.<verse eid="JDG 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 7:4" />Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Gidione, “Makambako ghamela twe, matumbukiye umache kupala najhighe. Peniya naninnobholela jhukujhenda nako. Na anda ninnobholile mangajhenda nako, bhahe, mangajhigha jhe kujhenda nako.” <verse eid="JDG 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 7:5" />Bhahe, Gidione ngabhalongwiya bhando kuloche na Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila, “Mabheke pakanjika bhando bhoha bhibhalapulii mache ngita ghimbwa, na bhando bhala bhibhanywe kone bhachutwime hele pabhe mabheka.” <verse eid="JDG 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 7:6" />Akakomana ngondo bhibhanywila kwakulapulii anda ghimbwa bhakaiki miya itato, nambo bhibhakaighilile bhanywila kwa kuchutama. <verse eid="JDG 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 7:7" />Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Gidione, “Kwa akakomana ngondo bhamba miya itato bhubhanywii anda ghimbwa, nanakombola aka Ichilahele na mangota namahotola aka Midiane. Bhange akakomana ngondo bhibhaighalile maleke bhakelebhuka kila mundo ukajhake.” <verse eid="JDG 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 7:8" />Yene, Gidione ngabhelekita aka Ichilehele bhange akakomana ngondo bhala bhakelebhuke ukajha. Ngaighala nabho miya itato bhala, bheniya ngabhatoila yakulya na mapenenga ghala bhibhakelebhuke ukajhabhe. Akamidiane kighono chabhe kikibha pahina nu pululambo.<verse eid="JDG 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 7:9" />Uhiko ghogho, Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Gidione, “Nnyende makajhingilile mwighono yabhe, nhwalo nantenda mahotole bheniya. <verse eid="JDG 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 7:10" />Nambo anda mipwelela, bhahe, nnyenda pamo na ntumiche gwino Pula. <verse eid="JDG 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 7:11" />Namajhoha chibhabombolokana kwenio, na mwe ma Gidione nankola makakala gha kwajhingilila.” Bhahe, Gidione ngalongohana na ntumiche mundo Pula ade kuighono ya ulonda ya Akamidiane. <verse eid="JDG 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 7:12" />Akakomana ngondo bha Akamidiane na aka Meleke na bhando bhake bhuupande ghulihumii lyobha bhapechengine kila chehemo pululambo. Bhakibha mbwe ngita madidima na ngamiya yabhe ibhalangika jhe, kujholoka kwake ngita ncheke gwa muupele jha mbwane.<verse eid="JDG 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 7:13" />Gidione pukiikita kipinde chenio, nganyoina mundo jhumo anchimulila nnyake maloto kubhehe, “Nnotii naha libumunda lya chayile likibhilingika ade pakighono cha Akamidiane, ngalibhulita lihema nu kulipendengulila hoko, ngakipechukila pahe.”<verse eid="JDG 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 7:14" />Ajhake ngabhakonyita, “Kilebhe chenje chengii jhe nambo ilangii upanga gwa Gidione mwana jwa Yoashi, mundo jwahumii ku Ichilahele. Bhambo Chapanga antehi kwahotola aka Midiane na akakomana ngondo bhoha.”<verse eid="JDG 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 7:15" />Gidione pajhohina maloto gheniya na mana ghake, ngannombita Chapanga. Yene ngabhujhita pakighono cha Akaichilahele nu kulonge, “Jhimuka, Bhambo Chapanga atutangatii kwahotola akakomana ngondo bha aka Midiane!” <verse eid="JDG 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 7:16" />Yene, ngabhabhaghanicha akakomana ngondo bhala miya itato mu ikunde itato, ngabhakamwiya mapenenga na ibhegha na mambolembole, <verse eid="JDG 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 7:17" />ngabhalobholila kubhehe, “Putubhandikii kighono, ntenda tela ngita chimbakutenda nenga. <verse eid="JDG 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 7:18" />Pumbakuhona lipenenga nenga na nchambe gwango, na mangota nhona mapenenga ghino kila upande nu kulonge kanonowa kubhehe, ‘Tutenda naha kwa nhwalo jha Chapanga na Gidione helahela!’ ”<verse eid="JDG 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 7:19" />Pubhandikila uhiko gwa kilo, Gidione na lilongo lyake lya bhando miya jhimo ngabhaika pukijhomokii kighono. Peniya ndi pukutumbulii kipinde cha akakomana ngondo bhibhajhanganana chamu jha ulonda. Ngabhahonita mapenenga nu kubhakajwila ibhegha ibhakibha nayo, <verse eid="JDG 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 7:20" />na malongo ghange ghala ngaghateila hele naha. Kongo bhakamwii mambolembole mulubhoko lwa ngejha nu lubhoko lwelo bhabhii na mapenenga bhahonita, na kongo bhalongila kanonoho kubhehe, “Upanga kwa nhwalo jha Bhambo Chapanga na kunhwalo jha Gidione!” <verse eid="JDG 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 7:21" />Bhoha ngabhajhema kutindi kighono choha cha Akamidiane. Akamidiane bhoha ngabhatila kone bhakemita mulete. <verse eid="JDG 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 7:22" />Akakomana ngondo bha Gidione pibhakibha bhahonita mapenenga ghabhe, Bhambo Chapanga ngabhateila Akamidiane kudodana bhene chika pakighono. Bhala bhangakomwa ngabhatilila ku Selela pahina nu ku Bete Shita mupakane mwa Abele Mehola pahina nu ku Tabate.<verse eid="JDG 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 7:23" />Akakomana ngondo bhange bha Akaichilahele bhibhahumila mu makabila gha ku Nafutale nu ku Ashele nu ku Manache, ngabhakengima Akamidiane. <verse eid="JDG 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 7:24" />Gidione ngatuma lilobhe kwa bhando bhibhatama muitombe ya ku Efulaimo kulonge, “Mwaibhilikiye Akamidiane mukapenganikiye mulijhomboko lya ku Bete Bala na helahela kulukemba lwaku Yoludane.” Yene, bhando bhoha bhaku Efulaimo ngabhalupenganikiya lukemba Yoludane ade ku Bete Bala. <verse eid="JDG 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 7:25" />Ngabhapukila ilongoche ibhele ya aka Midiane Olebo na Zeebo. Olebo ngakomilwa pala palindalabho lya Olebo na Zeebo ngakomilwa pala pikilibha chukuminyii divaye yaku Zeebo. Akakomana ngondo bhaku Efulaimo ngabhadumwila mitwe jha ilongoche ibhele ya aka Midiane nu kunkamuya Gidione kwiye jha lukemba Yoludane.<verse eid="JDG 7:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JDG 8" />
  <para style="s">Gideone abhahoto Akamidiane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 8:1" />Bhahe, bhando bha likabila lya aka Efulaimo ngabhankokolikiya hake Gidione, “Kilebhe ghane mututendi naha? Nhwalo ghane mukatukemiti jhe punkomina na Akamidiane?”<verse eid="JDG 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 8:2" />Nambo Gidione ngabhajhangwila, “Chindei nenga kilebhe nacho anda npemite ghala ghuntei mangota. Chela kichokombe chibhatei akakomana ngondo bhino aka Efulaimo ndi kikolongwa kuliku chitutei twenga bha lukolo lwa Abiezele. <verse eid="JDG 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 8:3" />Chapanga antehi mangota kwahotola ilongoche ya Akamidiane Olebo na Zeebo. Ne kibhii jhe chindei kumpeta mangota. Palongila naha Gidione, lilaka lyabhe lijhakubhehe temutemu.”<verse eid="JDG 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 8:4" />Bhahe, Gidione na ajhake miya itato bhala ngabhahika Yoludane, ngabhajhombwika pamonga nu kutotokela hake, ngabhajhendilila kwakengama akamakoko bhabhe. <verse eid="JDG 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 8:5" />Yene, Pibhaikita ku muche gwa ku Sukote ngabhalobholila bhando, “Apela chukulya bhando bhamba bhinongohine nabho nhwalo bhatotokii hake, na nenga nijhendelela kumpalaha akakolongwa bhuku Midiane Azeba na Asalimuna.”<verse eid="JDG 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 8:6" />Nambo ilongoche yuku Sukote ngabhankonya, “Nhwalo gwa nike twape chakulya kone munanhoto jhe munahota nkolongwa Zeba na Salimuna?”<verse eid="JDG 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 8:7" />Gidione ngajhangwila, “Tela nambo Bhambo Chapanga papakundangatila kwakamula, Azeba na Salimuna nangelebhuka nabho pamba, na nenga naniichwapula yegha jhino kwa mibha jha ku njenga!” <verse eid="JDG 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 8:8" />Pabhokita ku Sukote, Gidione ngajhenda ku Penuele, ngajhopita chukulyegha. Nambo ngabhanyangwila ngita hela chajhangwilwa na bhando bhuku muche gwa ku Sukote. <verse eid="JDG 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 8:9" />Bhahe, Gidione ngalongila, “Pumbakubhujha njelembo, naniutilula nnala ghongo!”<verse eid="JDG 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 8:10" />Zeba na Salimuna bhakibha kwenio ku Kalikole pamonga na akakomana ngondo bhabhe elufo kome nuhwano, akakomana ngondo bhibhakahighalike upandi ghulihumi lyobha, nhwalo akakomana ngondo Lake jhimo na elufo ichiline ngabhakomitwa. <verse eid="JDG 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 8:11" />Bhahe, Gidione ngapetila ndela upande ghulihumii lyobha mwa muiche jha ku Noba na ku Yoghibeya kwajhingilila akakomana ngondo bheniya kwa kwapwitikilila. <verse eid="JDG 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 8:12" />Akanahota akakolongwa bhuku Midiane, yane Azeba na Asalimuna ngabhanyogholwika, nambo Gidione ngabhabhutukila nu kwakamula, na kwatenda akakomana ngondo bhabhe bhoha kubhehe nikiholo hake.<verse eid="JDG 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 8:13" />Peniya, Gidione mwana jwa Yoashi ngakelebhuka kuhuma kungondo ngapetila mwijhinuko ya Helese. <verse eid="JDG 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 8:14" />Ngankamwila kangombo jhumo jwaku Sukote nu kunkonyekeya mahina gha ilongoche. Kangombo jwenio nganyandikila maina gha ilongoche imanyikina hake pamuche, ilongoche yoha ikaikii chabine na chaba. <verse eid="JDG 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 8:15" />Gidione ngakelebhwika kabhele ku muche gwa Sukote nu kulonge, “Bho, mikomboka chunighita nenga punongila, ‘Nhwalo ghane twape chakulya bhando bhino bhibhatotokii hake bhina njala kone munanhoto jhe Zeba na Salimuna?’ Dola, Zeba na Salimuna bhamba.” <verse eid="JDG 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 8:16" />Peniya, ngabhatola ilongoche bha muche gwenio na kwabula kwa mibha jhuku njenga kupala libhaha libholo kwa bhando bhoha bhu ku Sukote. <verse eid="JDG 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 8:17" />Helahela ngajhawila ku muche na kutilulina nnala ghuku Penuele na kwakoma akakolo kilambo bha kwenio.<verse eid="JDG 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 8:18" />Peniya, ngabhankonya Zeba pamonga na Salimuna, “Bho, bhando bhimakoma ku Tabole bhakibha bhando ghane?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 8:18">Ngabhajhangwila, “Bhakalandine na mwenga, nhwalo ibhonikina ngita yana ya munahota nkolongwa.”<verse eid="JDG 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 8:19" />Gideone ngajhangwila, “Yenio ndi ikibha inung'una yango, lutumbo lumo nanenga. Napila kwa Bhambo Chapanga jwabhii ghome kubhehe, anda namkwakoma jhe, nane helahela nganikomite jhe mangota.” <verse eid="JDG 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 8:20" />Peniya ngannobholila Yetele mwana jhulitibho, “Nnyeme, makome.” Nambo Yetele ateila kujhoghopa kutola upanga gwake nhwalo akibha amela mwana.<verse eid="JDG 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 8:21" />Bhahe, Zeba pamonga na Salimuna ngabhalonge, “Mutukome mwenga, mabhene nhwalo lihengo lyene lya mundo munahota.” Jwenio Gideone ngabhakoma na kutola ilekaleka ikibha mu mitandala jha ngamiya yabhe.<verse eid="JDG 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 8:22" />Peniya, aka Ichilahele ngabhannobholila Gideone, “Mwenga mma kilongoche jwito, nu kubhoke pukuwe nilongocha ibheluko ino, nhwalo mwe mutukombwile mu makakala gha aka Midiane.”<verse eid="JDG 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 8:23" />Gideone ngajhangwila, “Nenga nibhe jhe kilongoche gwino hilu mwanango abhe jhe kilongoche gwino, nambo Bhambo Chapanga ndi nabha kilongoche gwino.” <verse eid="JDG 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 8:24" />Yene ngabhalobhalila, “Ninnyopa kilebhe chimo, kila mundo ambe ndololo impokita.” Akamidiane bhakibha ngita Akaichumaile na bhando bhange bhibhatamita kunjenga bhawalita ndololo ya chaabo.<verse eid="JDG 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 8:25" />Bhando bheniya ngabhajhangwila, “Natumpela kukuhengwa mwojho.” Ngabhajhanjiya ngobho yabhe nu kubheka mwenio kila mundo ndololo yapokita Akamidiane. <verse eid="JDG 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 8:26" />Kutopa kwake ndololo yenio ikibha kilo makome mabhele. Pamonga na yenio ikibha ilebhe henge ngita ilebhe ya bei ngolongwa na ngobho ya chambalao yukuwala munahota nkolongwa jhuku Midiane na mikufo jhukuwalicha ngamiya yabhe. <verse eid="JDG 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 8:27" />Gideone ngatumila chaabo yenie ngatenginichila kinyagho ngabheka pikilambo chake chuku Ofula. Akachilahele bhoha ngabhajhenda kukijhinamila chenio. Ngikibhila ntambo kwa Gideone pamonga na akalongomundo.<verse eid="JDG 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 8:28" />Peniya aka Midiane ngabhannepilila njwe na bhakibha jhe kabhele kingobhahe kwa aka Ichilahele. Kilambo chuku Ichilahele ngikibhila njelembo kwa kipinde cha yaka makome ncheche.<verse eid="JDG 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuwe kwa Gidione</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 8:29" />Gideone, liina lenge Yelu Baale, mwana jwa Yoashi ngakelebhuka kajhake nu kutama kwenio. <verse eid="JDG 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 8:30" />Gideone akibha na yana inalome makome chaba, nhwalo akatolii akakeghe twe. <verse eid="JDG 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 8:31" />Akibha na kilaghe mu kilambo chuku Shekele ngampapii mwana munalome liina lyake Abimeleke. <verse eid="JDG 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 8:32" />Gideone mwana jwa Yoashi ngajhomwika pakibha na yaka ndiii, ngabhanchika umambe jha Yoashi tatemundo, mu kilambo cha Ofula mu lukolo lwa Akabiezele.<verse eid="JDG 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 8:33" />Machiko ghandina tugha pukujhomwoka kwake Gideone, aka Ichilahele ngibhabhujhila kabhele ichapanga Baale nu kuijhinamila. Ngabhantenda Baale Belite kubhehe kichapanga chabhe. <verse eid="JDG 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 8:34" />Akaichilahele ngabhannyewita Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga jwabhe, jwabhakombwila kubhoka kwa akamakoko bhabhe twe bhibhakibha bhatindikiye kila upandi. <verse eid="JDG 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 8:35" />Kabhele, bhatendii jhe ghambone akalongo bha Yelu Baale yane Gideone pamonga najwenio Gideone akatendii ghambone twe kwa aka Ichilahele.<verse eid="JDG 8:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JDG 9" />
  <para style="s">Abimeleke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 9:1" />Abimeleke mwana jwa Gideone, ngabhajhende akalongo bha majhemundo kubomane kwenio ku Chekemo kwalobholela, <verse eid="JDG 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 9:2" />“Unnobholele pambano pano palonge jha akakolo kilambo chiku Chekemo, ‘Cho chambone kwino, kubhehe yana inalome yoha chabine ya Gideone innongocha amu mwana jhumo? Nkomboka kubhehemangota na nenga ndi myahi jhino.’ ” <verse eid="JDG 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 9:3" />Akalongo bha majhemundo ngabhatangicha malobhe gheniya ku Chekemo jhoha kwa nhwalo jha jwenio, na bhando bhoha bhuku Chekemo ngabhankengama Abimeleke nhwalo akibha nnongo gwabhe. <verse eid="JDG 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 9:4" />Ngabhampila ipande chabine ya madine gha feza yenio yatoila munyumba jha kichapanga gwabhe, jwakemitwa Baale Belite, Abimeleke yenio atumila kwalepe bhando bhina milomo na mambyeta bhankengame jwenio. <verse eid="JDG 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 9:5" />Abimeleke na bhando bhake ngabhajhenda kukilambo chuku Ofula kwa tatemundo, kwenio ngabhakoma akakolomundo chabine yana inalome ya Gideone palighanga limo. Nambo ngaighalika Yotamo mwana nchokombe jwa Gideone akomitwe jhe, nhwalo akatei kujhobha. <verse eid="JDG 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 9:6" />Peniya akakolo kilambo bhoha bhuku Chekemo pamonga na bhuku Bete Milo ngabhakongana pamonga pahe jha nkongo nkolongwa gwa mwalone ku Chekemo, peniya ngabhanhagwila Abimeleke kubhehe munahota nkolongwa gwabhe.<verse eid="JDG 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 9:7" />Yotamo pajhoina gheniya, ngajhenda kujhema panane jhikitombe cha Gelizimo, na kulonge kulilobhe likolongwa, “Unyokanikiye mangota bhando bhuku Chekemo anda mipala Chapanga annyokanikiye. <verse eid="JDG 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 9:8" />Lichiko limo, mikongo ngikongina kukipalakiya munahota nkolongwa. Bhahe, nginnobholila nkongo ncheitune, ‘Mme makilongoche bhito!’ <verse eid="JDG 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 9:9" />Nambo nkongo gwa ncheitune ngaujhangwaila, ‘Mihambuka nihoto kulileka lihengo lyango likujhenga mahuta, ghighapalwa hake na ichapanga na bhando, peniya nyende kukichumbuya kwilongocha mikongo?’ <verse eid="JDG 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 9:10" />Peniya mikongo ngijhenda kulongele nkongo nkojho, ‘Nhwike mme makilongoche bhito.’ <verse eid="JDG 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 9:11" />Nambo nkojho ngaujhangwila, ‘Bho, mihambuka ne nihoto kulileka lihengo lyango lyukupambika uhohe gwambone nu kunogha, nikichumbuya kwilongocha mikongo?’ <verse eid="JDG 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 9:12" />Peniya mikongo jhenio ngaghulobholila nchabibo, ‘Nhwike kongo mme makilongoche bhito.’ <verse eid="JDG 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 9:13" />Nambo nchabibo gwenio ngaujhangwila, ‘Mihambuka ne nihoto kulileka lihengo lyango likuminya divaye jhihanganicha miojho ichapanga na bhando, nyende kukichumbuya kwilongocha mikongo?’ <verse eid="JDG 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 9:14" />Kujhomolela mikongo jhoha ngiijhenda kunkongo gwa mibha nukulonge, ‘Mwe nhwike mutulongoche twenga.’ <verse eid="JDG 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 9:15" />Nkongo gwa mibha gwenio ngaujhangwila, ‘Anda chakaka umbakumbe unahota nkolongwa, nhwikengane ntame pahe jha nhwile gwango. Nambo anda mikana kutenda yene, bhahe, mwotu ubhokela umibha jhango kwiikomelekeya mieleze jhiku kwenio ku Lebanone.’ ”<verse eid="JDG 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 9:16" />Peniya Yotamo ngajhendele kulonge, “Bho, mihambuka mtei Abimeleke kubhehe munahota nkolongwa kwa mwojho gwambone nu kukuhobholeka? Na mihambuka ntei ghambone kwa Gideone na akalongomundo chiipalwa, tela na itendwa yabhe? <verse eid="JDG 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 9:17" />Mikomboka kubhehe tategwango akakomanila na kunkombola kubhoke ku Midiane changajhoghopa kukomwa! <verse eid="JDG 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 9:18" />Nambo deleno majhingilii akalongo bha tate gwango na kwakoma yana inalome chabine pilighanga limo, peniya ngammeka Abimeleke kubhehe munahota nkolongwa mwana jwa mmanda mwikeghe jwa tategwango, abhe munahota nkolongwa jwa akakolo kilambo bhiku Chekemo nhwalo tu jhulungolo lwino. <verse eid="JDG 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 9:19" />Ngohe bhahe, anda ntei yene kwa mwojho gwambone nuichima Gideone pamonga ichapanga yake, bhahe, nhwanganila pamonga na Abimeleke, na jwenio Abimeleke ahangana pamonga na mangota. <verse eid="JDG 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 9:20" />Anda ibhii yene, bhahe mwotu upita kubhoka kwa Abimeleke gwakakomelekeya bhando bhuku Chekemo na Bete Milo, peniya mwotu ubhoke kubhando bheniya bhuku Chekemo, na bhando bhuku Beti Milo gwakomelekeya Abimeleke.” <verse eid="JDG 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 9:21" />Peniya Yotamo nganyogholwika nu kutila ngajhenda ku muche ghuku ku Beele, ngatama kwenio kukunnyoghopa Abimeleke. nnongomundo.<verse eid="JDG 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 9:22" />Abimeleke ngalongwicha kilambo chuku Ichilahele kwa kipinde cha yaka itato. <verse eid="JDG 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 9:23" />Peniya Bhambo Chapanga ngabhakomanicha pakate jha Abimeleke na bhando bhuku Chekemo, na bheniya ngabhang'alambwika Abimeleke. <verse eid="JDG 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 9:24" />Chapanga ngabhakomita bhando bhuku Shekemo, pamonga na akalongo bhake Abimeleke, kubhokana na uhakao bhibhakatei yana chabine bha Gideone. Luhadabulo lwenio ngabhapatite kunhwalo gwa Abimeleke ngabhakomita akalongo bhake kukutangatilwa bhando. <verse eid="JDG 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 9:25" />Bhando bhuku Chekemo ngabhabheka bhando kuilegheleghe itombe bhajhobhele bhando bhibhapeta mwenio na kwapoka ilebhe yabhe. Gheniya ghoha ngabhannobholila Abimeleke.<verse eid="JDG 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 9:26" />Lichiko limo Gaale mwana jwa Ebede, pamonga na akalongo bhake ngabhajhenda kutama ku Chekemo, na bhando bha kwenio ngabhanhobholila Gaale. <verse eid="JDG 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 9:27" />Ngabhajhenda mumighonda jhabhe nu kuhuna chabibo, ngabhaminya divaye nukubheka unyagho. Ngabhajhingila munyumba jhi ichapanga jhabhe. Kipinde chibhalila nu kunywe ngabhannigha Abimeleke. <verse eid="JDG 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 9:28" />Gaale mwana jwa Ebede ngalonge, “Abimeleke ndi meneke? Twenga pano Chekemo ndi bhando bha namuna ghane ade tuntumikila Abimeleke? Gideone na ntangatila Zebuli ngabhatumikila bhando bha Amole tatemundo Chekemo, kilebhe ghane twe tuntumikila Abimeleke? <verse eid="JDG 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 9:29" />Kabhele bhando bheniya nalongwicha nenga, kabhele nimoite Abimeleke, ninnobholii Abimeleke, ‘Nnyonjekeye akakomana ngondo bhino, nhwike tubulane palonge jha bhando naninhotola.’ ”<verse eid="JDG 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 9:30" />Zebule, kilongoche jwa muche, pajhoina gheniya gha Gaale mwana jwa Ebede, ngachimwa hake. <verse eid="JDG 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 9:31" />Bhahe, Zebule ngantumila lilobhe Abimeleke kwenio ku Tolima kulonge, “Gaale, mwana jwa Ebede, pamonga na akalongomundo bhabhii pamba ku Chekemo na bhakwelekeya bhando bhang'alambuke mwenga na bhando bhino ku Chekemo. <verse eid="JDG 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 9:32" />Deleno mmujhe mwenga pamonga na bhando bhino kilo majhobhela mu yeghejha pahina na muche ghuku Chekemo na kwajhobhela. <verse eid="JDG 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 9:33" />Kilabho lukela lyobha pilipakupita majhingilila. Gaale papakuika na bhando bhake kubulana na mwenga, namwe mabula chimihotola.”<verse eid="JDG 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 9:34" />Abimeleke ngabhoka pamonga na bhando bhake bhakibha nabho, ngaika ku Chekemo kilo. Ngabhaghina bhando bhake ibhogha ncheche na ngabhajhobha kwenio pahina na pa muche. <verse eid="JDG 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 9:35" />Bhahe, Gaale mwana jwa Ebede ngapita panja nu kutama pannyango gwa kilambo, kipinde chenio Abimeleke na bhando bhake bhakibha bhapitila chehemo pakibha bhajhobhila. <verse eid="JDG 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 9:36" />Gaale pabhabhona bhando bheniya ngannobholila Zebule, “Dolokeya, bhando bhihuluka kunane kukitombe.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 9:36">Zebule ngalonge, “Mwe mibhona iyeka iitombe ngita bhando bhibhatyanga.”<verse eid="JDG 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 9:37" />Gaale ngalonge kabhele, “Dolekeya, bhando bhitenda kuika mu kilambo na kibhogha chenge kibhoke upande gwa nkongo nkolongwa gwa Mwalone gwa nnondola.”<verse eid="JDG 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 9:38" />Peniya, Zebule ngalonge kabhele, “Kulokaloka kwino kubhii kojhe ngohe? Chi mwe jhe nnongila kubhehe Abimeleke ndi meneke? Nhwalo gwa nike tuntumikile? Bheniya ndi bhando bhimapuchita, nnyende bhakabulane nabho.” <verse eid="JDG 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 9:39" />Gaale ngabhoka na kwalongoya bhando bhuku Chekemo kubulana na Abimeleke. <verse eid="JDG 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 9:40" />Gaale ngalepilila nu kutila kongo akengimilwa na Abimeleke. Bhando twe ngabhakomilwa undela ade pannyango nkolongwa ghukujhingilii pa muche. <verse eid="JDG 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JDG 9:41" />Peniya, Abimeleke ngajhenda kutama ku Aluma na Zebule ngammenga Gaale pamonga na akalongomundo bhabhoke pa muche ghuku Chekemo.<verse eid="JDG 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JDG 9:42" />Lichiko lilikengima, Abimeleke ngajhoha kubhehe bhando bhuku Chekemo bhajhawile kumighonda. <verse eid="JDG 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JDG 9:43" />Abimeleke ngabhabhaghina akakomana ngondo bhake ikunde ncheche, nu kujhenda kwajhobhela kwenio kumighonda. Pibhabhona bhakabhoka pa muche, ngabhoka pibhajhobhite na kwakoma. <verse eid="JDG 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JDG 9:44" />Abimeleke pamonga na kikunde chake ngabhajhenda kajhombe kuhibhilila pannyango nkolongwa gwa pa muche gwenio kupala akoto kujhingii mundo nkate. Ikunde henge ibhele ngabhajhingilila bhando bhibhakibha kumighonda na kwakoma. <verse eid="JDG 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JDG 9:45" />Abimeleke ngabulina na bhando bhikilambo chenio lyobha tipi. Ngabhakoma bhando bhoha ngatola muche gwenio kwa makakala na ngamichita mwinyo pa muche gwenio.<verse eid="JDG 9:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JDG 9:46" />Bhando bhoha bhibhatamita pa nnala ghuku Chekemo pibhajhoa malobhe gheniya, ngabhatilila kuliboma lya nyumba jha ichapanga jwakemitwa Eli Belite. <verse eid="JDG 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JDG 9:47" />Abimeleke pajhoha kubhehe bhando bhoha bhibhakibha pannala ghuku Chekemo bhakonganike pamonga. <verse eid="JDG 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JDG 9:48" />Abimeleke na bhando bhake ngabhajhenda kukitombe chikikemwa Salimone, ngatola libhagho nukupengu lindabhe lya nkongo ngalighenga pilibhegha lyake. Peniya ngabhepeleke bhando bhakibha nabho, ntenda kajhombe ngita chindei nenga. <verse eid="JDG 9:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JDG 9:49" />Kila mundo ngapengu lindabhe ngita Abimeleke. Ngabhatola mandabhe ghabhe nukujhegheka mulipamanda lya liboma, ngabhajhocha mwotu nu kutiniya liboma lyenio, bhando bhoha akanalome na akakeghe ngita elufo jhimo bhibhakibha mwenio, ngabhawila.<verse eid="JDG 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JDG 9:50" />Peniya Abimeleke na akakomana ngondo bhake ngabhajhenda ku muche gwaku Telesi, ngabhautindila nukupukila kwa makakala muche gwenio. <verse eid="JDG 9:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JDG 9:51" />Nambo nkate jha muche gwenio, kukibha na nnala nganganga hake pakate jha muche. Peniya bhando bhoha akanalome na akakeghe na ilongoche yabhe ngabhatilila mwenio nu kukidindila nkate. Ngabhakwelita kunane jha nnala gwenio. <verse eid="JDG 9:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JDG 9:52" />Abimeleke ngaika kupala kubula nnala ngajhenda pannyango gwa nnala nambo paheghelila kupala ajhoche mwotu, <verse eid="JDG 9:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JDG 9:53" />mwikeghe jhumo ngatagha lwalwa kubhoke kunane ngilimpwechwila Abimeleke umuto gwake menyemenye. <verse eid="JDG 9:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JDG 9:54" />Peniya Abimeleke ngankema kajhombe kangombo jwake jwakibha agheghita chilaa jhake, “Ntole upanga gwino ungome, bhando bhangaika jhe kulonge kubhehe ngomitwe na mwikeghe.” Kangombo jwenio ngatola upanga gwake ngankoma Abimeleke. <verse eid="JDG 9:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JDG 9:55" />Akaichilahele pibhammona Abimeleke ajhomwike, ngabhabhujha kila mundo kajhake.<verse eid="JDG 9:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="JDG 9:56" />Yene Chapanga ndi channepita Abimeleke nhwalo ghu lilemwa lyabhalimwile akatate mundo kwa kwakoma akalongo mundo chabine. <verse eid="JDG 9:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JDG 9:57" />Helahela Chapanga ngabhalekikiya bhando bhuku Chekemo bhachwapulwe kwa ubhoho ghubhateila. Yene likoto lya Yotamo mwana jwa Yelu Baale ndi ngalyapatita.<verse eid="JDG 9:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JDG 10" />
  <para style="s">Tola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 10:1" />Pajhomwika Abimeleke, Tola mwana jwa Pua, nchokolo jwa Dodo, jwa likabila lya Ichakale, ngabhakombwila Akaichilahele. Tola atamita ku muche gwaku Shamili, mu kilambo china itombe ya ku Efulaimo. <verse eid="JDG 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 10:2" />Jwenio ngabhalongwicha aka Ichilahele kwa yaka ichiline na mitato, peniya ngajhomwika, ngabhanchika ku kilambo chuku Shamile<verse eid="JDG 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yaile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 10:3" />Papetita Tola, ngapitila Yaili jhuku Geleade, ngabhila kilongoche jwa aka Ichilahele kwa kipinde cha yaka ichiline nimibhele. <verse eid="JDG 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 10:4" />Yaili akibha na yana makome matato inalome na ikibha ihobhokila maponda makome matato, kabhele bhakibha na miche makome matato mu kilambo chuku Gileade, yenio ade ngohe ikemwa Hawote Yaili yane chenda ya Yaili. <verse eid="JDG 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 10:5" />Yaili ngajhomwika nu kuchikwa muchenda jha Kamone.<verse eid="JDG 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yefuta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 10:6" />Akaichilahele ngabhatenda kabhele uhakaho nnonge jha Bhambo Chapanga ngibhijhinamila inyagho ichapanga Baale na Mashitalote, na inyagho ya Shamo deleno ikemwa Siliya pamonga na ichapanga ya Alamo na ya Moabo na ya Amone na yaka Filichite. Ngabhanneka Chapanga na bhanyinamii jhe kabhele. <verse eid="JDG 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 10:7" />Lilaka lya Bhambo Chapanga ngilijhaka kwa aka Ichilahele, yene ngabhatenda bhalepelele kwa aka Filichite na aka Amone. <verse eid="JDG 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 10:8" />Kwa yaka kome na nane bheniya ngabhabulita na kubhonelwa Akaichilahele mu kilambo cha ku Gileade chehemo jha aka Amole upande ghulipitii lyobha mwa lukemba lwa Yoludane. <verse eid="JDG 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 10:9" />Akaamole nabheniya ngabhajhombwika lukemba Yoludane kupala kubulana na bhando bha likabila lya Yuda na Benjamine na Efulaimo. Na Akaichilahele ngabhalaghita hake.<verse eid="JDG 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 10:10" />Peniya Akaichilahele ngabhannelila Bhambo Chapanga kulonge, “Tuntendii uhakaho, nhwalo tunnekite mwenga Bhambo Chapanga gwito, tuitumikii ichapanga Baale.”<verse eid="JDG 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 10:11" />Bhambo Chapanga ngabhajhangwila, “Ne ndi jhunikombwila kubhoka kwa aka Michile na Akaamone na aka Amole na aka Filichite. <verse eid="JDG 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 10:12" />Bho, nikankombwii jhe kubhoke kwa Akachidone na aka Ameleke na Akamidiane, pabhang'ahita na mangota ngunnelila nenga, nane nganinkombwila kubhoka kwabhe? <verse eid="JDG 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 10:13" />Nambo mwamela mijhendelela mikatumikii ichapanga henge. Yene ninkombo ng'o kabhele. <verse eid="JDG 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 10:14" />Nnyenda mikailelela ichapanga ino jhimihagwile, mileka jhenio jhinkombola mu mang'ahe ghino!”<verse eid="JDG 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 10:15" />Nambo aka Ichilahele ngabhannobholila Bhambo Chapanga, “Tuntendii uhakaho. Mututenda tu chimpaile, nambo twe tunnyopa mutukombole deleno.” <verse eid="JDG 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 10:16" />Peniya, ngibhitaghila kutale ichapanga jhikighene, ngabhannyinamila kabhele Bhambo Chapanga. Na Bhambo Chapanga ahotwii jhe kujhendelela kuimbilila kwabhona aka Ichilahele bhakang'aika.<verse eid="JDG 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 10:17" />Akaamone ngabhakongana pamonga ngabhabheka kighono chabhe kwenio ku Geleade. Na bhene aka Ichilahele ngabhakongana pamonga ngabheka kighono chabhe kwenio ku Misipa jhuku Gileade. <verse eid="JDG 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 10:18" />Ilongoche ya bhando bhuku Gileade ngabhakonyana, “Meneke natumbula kubulana na aka Amone? Jwapakutenda yene ndi jwapakubhe kilongoche jwa bhando bhoha bha kwenio ku Gileade.”<verse eid="JDG 10:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JDG 11" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 11:1" />Kwenio ku Gileade pakibha na mundo jhumo nkomana ngondo jwangajhoghopa, jwakemitwa Yefuta, mwana jwa majhe jhumo nngongola, na tatemundo akemitwa Geleade. <verse eid="JDG 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 11:2" />Geleade helahela akibha na yana henge kwa nhwanamundo jhukutolana. Kipinde yana ya jwenio pikibha ikolite ngimmenga Yefuta kukunongolela abhoke pakajha peniya, innobholila, “Mwe mmoke mipalwa jhe kubhujhii ilebhe ya tate gwito nhwalo mwe mamwana jwa mwikeghe jhonge.” <verse eid="JDG 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 11:3" />Peniya Yefuta ngabhatila akalongo mundo nu kujhenda kutama kukilambo chuku Tobu. Kwenio bhando bhanganandela ngabhakonganika pamonga na jwenio, ngabhankengima pajhenda.<verse eid="JDG 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 11:4" />Pikipetita kipinde, bhando bha likabila lya Akaamone ngabhajhenda kukomana na aka Ichilahele. <verse eid="JDG 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 11:5" />Kipinde cha Akaamone pibhakomina ngondo, ighogholo yuku Geleade ngaijhenda kuntola Yefuta kukilambo chuku Tobu, <verse eid="JDG 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 11:6" />ngabhannobholila, “Nhwike mutulongoye mungondo jhito na aka Amone.”<verse eid="JDG 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 11:7" />Nambo Yefuta ngabhalobholela ighogholo yuku Gileade, “Bho, chi unjimwita ade kumenga kubhoka kwa akalongo bhango? Ngohe kilebhe ghane nhwikilila kongo mmii miho pyuu?”<verse eid="JDG 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 11:8" />Ighogholo yenio ngainnobholila, “Chakaka tukammengite, nambo ngohe tung'alambukile mwenga tujhende na twenga tukabulane na aka Amone, nu kubhoke pakwahotola mwe mma makilongoche bhito na bhando bhoha bhuku Gileade.”<verse eid="JDG 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 11:9" />Yefuta ngailobholila ighogholo yene yuku Gileade, “Anda nyawile na mangota na Bhambo Chapanga anda nandangatila kwahotola aka Amone, bho, nenga namaa nakilongoche gwino.”<verse eid="JDG 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 11:10" />Ighogholo yenio ngainobholila Yefuta, “Bhambo Chapanga nabha nchaile jwito, kubhehe twenga natuhenga ngita chitulongile.” <verse eid="JDG 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 11:11" />Yefuta ngalongohana na ighogholo yuku Gileade, nabhene ngabhammeka abhe kilongoche jwabhe. Yefuta ngabhujhila kulonge malobhe ghoha kola ku Misipa palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga.<verse eid="JDG 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 11:12" />Peniya, Yefuta ngatuma bhando bhajhende kumunahota nkolongwa jwaka Amone kunkonya, “Mwe mmi nabhulo ghane natwenga ade nhwike kutujhingilila kukilambo chito?”<verse eid="JDG 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 11:13" />Munahota nkolongwa jhuku Amone ngabhajhangwila bhando bheniya kulonge, “Akaichilahele pibhabhujhita kukilambo chuku Michile, ngabhatola kilambo chango kubhoke lukemba lwa Alinone ade lukemba lwa Yaboke pamonga nulukemba lwa Yoludane. Ngohe umbela kilambo chango kwa uteeke.”<verse eid="JDG 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 11:14" />Yefuta ngatumita akatenga kabhele kwa munahota nkolongwa jhuku Amone, <verse eid="JDG 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 11:15" />ngabhannobholele kubhehe, “Akaichilahele bhakatoi jhe kilambo chaku Moabo hilu kilambo cha Akaamone. <verse eid="JDG 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 11:16" />Nambo Akaichilahele pibhabhoka ku Michile, bhatyangita munjenga kubhoka kumbwane jhiku Chamo ade ku Kadeshi. <verse eid="JDG 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 11:17" />Peniya aka Ichilahele ngabhatuma akatenga kwa munahota nkolongwa jhuku Edomo kunnyopa ajheketele bhapeta mu kilambo chabhe. Nambo munahota nkolongwa jhuku Edomo ngakana, bhahe, ngannyopa munahota nkolongwa jhuku Moabo na jwenio helahela ngakanita. Yene aka Ichilahele ngabhaighala ku Kadeshi. <verse eid="JDG 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 11:18" />Peniya aka Ichilahele ngabhapeta ndela jhukunjenga kutindii kilambo chuku Edomu nikilambo chuku Moabo, ade pibhaika upande ghulihumii lyobha mwa kilambo chu ku Moabo, ngabhabheka kighono kwiye jhilukemba lwa Alinone. Nambo bhakajhingii jhe ku Moabo. Yene lukemba lwa Alinone lukibha ndi mpaka gwa kilambo chuku Moabo. <verse eid="JDG 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 11:19" />Peniya aka Ichilahele ngabhatuma bhange akatenga kwa munahota nkolongwa Sihone jwaku Amole okwe ku Heshibone, ngabhannyopa ajheketele bhapetele mu kilambo chake kupala bhajhende mu kilambo chabhe. <verse eid="JDG 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 11:20" />Nambo Sihone akajhaketii jhe Akaichilahele bhapete mu kilambo chabhe. Peniya Sihone ngakonganicha akakomana ngondo bhake pamonga, ngabheka kighono okwe ku Yahasa, ngabhakomina na Akaichilahele. <verse eid="JDG 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 11:21" />Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga jwa aka Ichilahele ngabhatangatila Akaichilahele kwahotola Sihone pamonga na akakomana ngondo bhake. Yene Akaichilahele ngabhatola kilambo choha cha Akaamole bhubhatamita mwenio. <verse eid="JDG 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 11:22" />Ngabhatoila chehemo jhoha jha Akaamole kutumbulii lukemba lwa Alinone ade lukemba lwa Yaboke nu kubhoke kunjenga upande ghulihumii lyobha mwa lukemba Yoludane ade kuupande kulitipikii lyobha. <verse eid="JDG 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 11:23" />Yene Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga jwa aka Ichilahele, ngabhabhenga aka Amole kone Akaichilahele bhikilola. Bho, namwe mipala kutupoka kilambo chito? <verse eid="JDG 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 11:24" />Bho, ngohe chi ntole chela champii kichapanga gwino Kemoshi? Nambo kilambo chochoha Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga jwito chabhabhengite bhando bhibhakibha bhatamita mwenio, nu kutupe twenga, kilambo chenio ndi chito twenga. <verse eid="JDG 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 11:25" />Bho, mihambuka mwe mina makakala kumpeta Balake mwana jwa Zipole jwakibha munahota nkolongwa jhukilambo chiku Moabo? Jwenio ataungine jhe na aka Ichilahele hilu kubulana nabho. <verse eid="JDG 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 11:26" />Kwa yaka miya tato aka Ichilahele bhibhatamita mu muche jhuku Heshibone nu ku Aloele, na chenda yake itindii peniya na miche yoha ibhii muupele jha lukemba Alinone. Kwanike mangota mikombwii jhe chehemo jhenio jhoha? <verse eid="JDG 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 11:27" />Nenga nemwite jhe kilebhe. Nambo mangota ntenda kulemwa piminyingilila. Bhambo Chapanga ndi nakenga. Jwenio ndi jwahadabula deleno pakate jha Ichilahele na bhando buku Amone.” <verse eid="JDG 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 11:28" />Nambo munahota nkolongwa jwaku Amone ngapuchita nhwalo gwenio gwalobholilwa na Yefuta.<verse eid="JDG 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 11:29" />Peniya Uhuke gwa Bhambo Chapanga ngihwikilila Yefuta, jwenio ngabhoka kukupete ndela jhiku Geleade na Manache, ngabhujhila ku Misipa mu kilambo chuku Geleade nu kujhendelela kujhenda kukomana na Akaamole. <verse eid="JDG 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 11:30" />Yefuta ngabheka nachile kwa Bhambo Chapanga kulonge, “Anda nahotwii kwabula akakomana ngondo bha Akaamone, <verse eid="JDG 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 11:31" />bhahe, jhojhoha jwapakupita panja munyumba jhango anda ngongine nako pambakubhujha kubhoka kwahotola aka Amone, jwenio nabha jwino mwe Bhambo Chapanga. Nanimpiya kwino kubhehe litambiko likukomelekeya.”<verse eid="JDG 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 11:32" />Bhahe, Yefuta ngajhombwika lukemba, ngabulina na aka Amone. Bhambo Chapanga ngabhatenda kwahotola aka Amone. <verse eid="JDG 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 11:33" />Ngabhahotwila ngatola kwa makakala chenda makome mabhele pakate jha Aloele na chehemo jhitindii Minite na Abele Kelamimo. Bhahe, aka Amone ngabhalepelila hake kwa aka Ichilahele.<verse eid="JDG 11:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kamwale jwa Yefuta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 11:34" />Yefuta pabhujhita kajhake ku Mizipa, kamwale jwake ngapita panja nu kumbokela, kongo akapeta kuhanganila nukina kwa kuona kang'oma. Kamwale jwenio akibha ndi mwana jhika jhake. Yefuta akibha jhe na mwana jhonge munalome hilu kamwale jhonge. <verse eid="JDG 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 11:35" />Yefuta pamwonita tugha jwenio kamwale ngakenjwila ngobho yake kwa ungolongonde nu kulonge, “Aka mwanango! Umbomwii mwojho. Mwe ndi kihokola cha malola ghanga ghoha. Ne napile kwa Bhambo Chapanga, nhoto jhe kutwekuu kilapo chango.”<verse eid="JDG 11:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 11:36" />Na jwenio ngalonge, “Matate anda nnapii kilebhe kwa Bhambo Chapanga, bhahe, mwe militenda ngita chinapii, nhwalo ngohe anhotwiye kwalepechela akamakoko bhino Akaamone.” <verse eid="JDG 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 11:37" />Peniya, ngannobholila tatemundo, “Ninnyopa kilebhe chimo tugha, umbe machiko gha myehe mibhele, nyende na akakoche bhango kukitombe, nikalele kabula jha kuwe kwango, nhwalo niwe changatolana na munalome.” <verse eid="JDG 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 11:38" />Tatemundo ngannyeketila ajhende kwenio kwa myehe mibhele. Na jwenio ngajhenda pamonga na akakoche mundo, ngabhalelita kwa nhwalo ghukujhomwoka kwake changatolana na munalome. <verse eid="JDG 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 11:39" />Piipetita myehe mibhele ngabhujha ukajha, peniya tatemundo ngantende tela nachile jhake. Kamwale jwenio anawahi jhe kutolana namunalome.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 11:39">Peniya, ndi ngapabhila nuluhomo londo ku Ichilahele.<verse eid="JDG 11:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 11:40" />Kila chaka achikabhale bhuku Ichilahele ujhenda kulela machiko ncheche kukunkombokela bite Yefuta jhuku Geleade.<verse eid="JDG 11:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JDG 12" />
  <para style="s">Yefuta na likabila lya Efulaimo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 12:1" />Bhando bha likabila lya Efulaimo ngabhakongana akakomana ngondo pamonga na kujhomboka lukemba lwa Yoludane, ngabhaika kwenio ku Zafone. Peniya, ngabhannobholila Yefuta, “Kilebhe ghane mutukemitii jhe tulongohane pamonga kujhenda kukomana na Akaamone? Ngohe natuijhocha mwotu nyumba jhino na mabhene mmi mwenio.”<verse eid="JDG 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 12:2" />Yefuta ngalonge, “Nenga pamonga na bhando bhango tukibha na bhulo nkolongwa na Akaamone. Nanenga pininkemita nhwikite jhe kundangatila. <verse eid="JDG 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 12:3" />Nenga pinolita kubhehe nhwikite jhe kundangatila, nganyawila changajhoghopa kuwegha kubulana Akaamone, Bhambo Chapanga ngambila uhotolo gwa kwahotola. Kilebhe ghane ngohe miika kubulana na nenga?” <verse eid="JDG 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 12:4" />Bhahe, Yefuta ngabhakema bhando bhoha bhuku Geleade nu kubulana na Efulaimo. Bhando bha ku Geliade ngabhahotwila kwabula bhando bha Efulaimo. Aka Efulaimo bheniya ndi bhilonge, “Mangota mabhando bhuku Geleade bhinyogholwika kubhoke mu likabila lya Efulaimo nganyenda ku likabila lya Manache.” <verse eid="JDG 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 12:5" />Akageleade ngabhapukila kwa makakala majhomboko gha lukemba lwa Yoludane, kupala kuhibha ndela jha bhando bhuku Efulaimo. Pahikita mundo jwatila ngondo pajhopita kujhomboka kwenio, aka Geleade bhankonyita, “Mwe, bho ma Efulaimo?” Na anda alongii, “Ne jhe,” <verse eid="JDG 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 12:6" />peniya nabhalongela, hajha nnonge ote, “Shibolete,” nambo jwenio ulonge, “Sibolete,” mana ghake aka Efulaimo mihoto jhe kulonge lilobhe lyenio mbone. Bhahe, ngabhampukila kwa makakala, nu nkukoma kwenio kulyomboko lya lukemba lwa Yoludane. Bhando bhuku Efulaimo elufo alobaine ni ibhele ngabhakomwa kipinde chenio.<verse eid="JDG 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 12:7" />Yefuta akibha mundo jwahumii kubomane jwa ku Geleade ngabhila kilongoche kwa kipinde cha yaka chita. Ngajhomwika na ngabhanchika kwenio, mu ku muche kwenio ku Geleade.<verse eid="JDG 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ibizane na Elone na Abidone</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 12:8" />Pajhomwika Yefuta, Ibizane jwaku Betelehemo ngabhila kilongoche jwa Akaichilahele. <verse eid="JDG 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 12:9" />Jwenio akibha na yana makome matato inalome na yana makome matato ikeghe. Ichikana yake ngaitolanikicha panja na likabila lyake, na ngabhatolila akakeghe makome matato kubhoka mulenge likabila bhatolane na yana yake inalome. Ibizane ngalongwicha aka Ichilahele kwa kipinde cha yaka chaba, <verse eid="JDG 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 12:10" />peniya Ibizane ngajhomwika ngachikwa kwenio ku Betelehemo.<verse eid="JDG 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 12:11" />Pajhomwika Ibizane, ngaika Elone jwa likabila lya Chabulone ngalongwicha aka Ichilahele kwa kipinde cha yaka kome. <verse eid="JDG 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 12:12" />Peniya Ayalone helahela ngajhomwika, ngabhanchika ku Ayalone mu kilambo chuku Chabulone.<verse eid="JDG 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 12:13" />Pajhomwika Elone, ngaika Abidone mwana jwa Hileli, jwa likabila lya Pilatone, ngabhila kilongoche jwa aka Ichilahele. <verse eid="JDG 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 12:14" />Abidone akibha na yana inalome makome ncheche, na ichokolo makome matato ihobhokii maponda makome chaba. Abidone ngabhila kilongoche jwa aka Ichilahele kwa kipinde cha yaka nane. <verse eid="JDG 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 12:15" />Peniya, Abidone ngajhomwika ngabhanchika ku muche ghuku Pilatone mu kilambo chu likabila lya Efulaimo.<verse eid="JDG 12:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JDG 13" />
  <para style="s">Kubhelukwa kwa Samusone</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 13:1" />Akaichilahele ngabhatenda kabhele uhakaho palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, jwenio Bhambo Chapanga ngabhaleka bhalongochwe kukubhonelwa na aka Filichite kwa kipinde cha yaka makome ncheche.<verse eid="JDG 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 13:2" />Pakibha na mundo jhumo jwaku Sola, jwa likabila lya Dane, liina lyake akemitwa Manowa. Nhwanamundo akibha jhe na mwana nhwalo gwa utonga. <verse eid="JDG 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 13:3" />Lichiko limo ntumiche jwa kunane kwa Chapanga ngampitila mwikeghe jwenie nu kunnobholela, “Mwe, makahotwii jhe kubhehe na yana, nambo ngohe nampata ndumbo nu kupapa mwana munalome. <verse eid="JDG 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 13:4" />Ngohe mma miho manganywe jhe divaye hilu kulobhela chochoha, na hilu mangalye jhe kilebhe chochoha changajheketelwa palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, <verse eid="JDG 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 13:5" />na mwana papakubhelukwa, manganchekujhe majhunjo, nhwalo apakulumikwa kwa lihengo lya Chapanga. Natumbula kwakombola aka Ichilahele kubhoka mu makakala gha aka Filichite.”<verse eid="JDG 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 13:6" />Ndi mwikeghe jwenio ngajhenda kunnobholela unganamundo kubhehe, “Mundo jwa Chapanga ngaika nu kumio jhake kukibha kujhogwiya hake ngita ntumiche jhukubhoka kunane kwa Chapanga, nanenga ninkonyitejhe kubhehe nhumii koo? Na liina lyake alongiijhe. <verse eid="JDG 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 13:7" />Nambo ngannobholila, mpakubhe na ndumbo nu kupapa mwana munalome. Ngohe manganywe jhe divaye hilu kulobhela na mangalye jhe kilebhe chochoha changajheketelwa palonge jha Chapanga nhwalo mwana jwenio apakubhe jwa nyahinyahi jwa Chapanga kuhumii mulutumbo ade kuwe kwake.”<verse eid="JDG 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 13:8" />Peniya Manowa ngannyopa Chapanga kulonge, “Mwe Mabhambo, nanjino nimpala mundo jwa Chapanga aike kabhele atulobholele ilebhe ipalwa kukamula kwa mwana jwenio jwapala kubhelukwa.”<verse eid="JDG 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 13:9" />Bhambo Chapanga ngajhowa malobhe ghajhopa Manowa, na ntumiche jwa kunane kwa Chapanga ngannyendila kabhele mwikeghe jhola kipinde pakibha kung'onda, nambo Manowa unganamundo mwikeghe jwenio akibha jhe. <verse eid="JDG 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 13:10" />Bhahe, mwikeghe jwenio ngajhenda kajhombe kwa unganamundo, ngalonge, “Nnola! Mundo jhola ambitii kabhele, jhola jwanhikilila lichiko lela.”<verse eid="JDG 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 13:11" />Manowa ngalongohina na nhwanamundo kujhenda ade kwa mundo jhola, ngankonya, “Bho, mwe ndi jwamalongela na nhwana gwango?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 13:11">Jwenio ngajhangwila, “Ena, ndi nenga.”<verse eid="JDG 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 13:12" />Manowa ngalonge, “Malobhe ghino pighapakulenganila, bho, mambu ghane ghipalwa tughahenga kunhwalo jha mwana jwenio? Bho, lihengo lya mwana nalibhaha nike?”<verse eid="JDG 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 13:13" />Ntumiche jwa kunane kwa Chapanga ngannobholila Manowa, “Nhwana gwino ipalwa akamula malobhe ghoha ghininnobholile. <verse eid="JDG 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 13:14" />Angalye jhe kilebhe chochoha chikibhoke muchabibo hilu anganywe jhe divaye hilu kulobhela chochoha na angalye jhe kilebhe chochoha changajheketelwa palonge jha Chapanga, gheniya ghoha ipalwa aghakamula.”<verse eid="JDG 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 13:15" />Manowa ngannobholila ntumiche jwenio jwa Bhambo Chapanga, “Tunnyopa ntame ote pandina tunnenganikiye katohe ka mbuhe kwa nhwalo gwino.” <verse eid="JDG 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 13:16" />Nambo ntumiche jwa Bhambo jwa kunane kwa Chapanga ngannobholila Manowa, “Mangang'aghalila jhe kulye chakulya chino. Nambo anda mpahile nnenganikiya litambiko lyukukomelekeya, mpiikiya Bhambo Chapanga.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 13:16">Manowa akamanyii jhe kubhehe jwenio akibha ntumiche jwa kunane kwa Chapanga.<verse eid="JDG 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 13:17" />Manowa ngannobholila, “Liina lino ghane kupala ilebhe yenie pipakulenganila tumpe ichima.”<verse eid="JDG 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 13:18" />Ntumiche jwa kunane kwa Chapanga ngankonya, “Nhwalo gwa nike mingonya liina lyango? Liina lyango nenga lya kukangacha.”<verse eid="JDG 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 13:19" />Peniya Manowa ngatola litohe lya mbuhe pamonga na litambiko lya ukobha ngajhenda kumpiikiya Bhambo Chapanga panane pilighanga. Ntumiche jwa kunane kwa Chapanga jwatenda ilebhe yu kukangacha, Manowa pamonga na nhwanamundo ngibhiibhona yenie. <verse eid="JDG 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 13:20" />Kipinde Manowa na nhwanamundo pibhalolikiya nime ya mwotu yakajhenda kunane kwa Chapanga kubhoke pachehemo jhukupiikiya litambiko, ngabhammona ntumiche jwa kunane kwa Chapanga jwenio akajhenda kunane kwa Chapanga pamonga nime ya mwotu yenio. Peniya Manowa na nhwanamundo ngabhagwila mangukama kunyinamila. <verse eid="JDG 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 13:21" />Manowa ngamanya jwenio akibha ntumiche jwa Bhambo Chapanga. Na jwenio ntumiche jwa Bhambo Chapanga ampitii jhe kabhele Manowa na nhwana mundo.<verse eid="JDG 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 13:22" />Manowa ngannobholila nhwanamundo, “Chakaka tupakuwegha, nhwalo tumweine Chapanga.”<verse eid="JDG 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 13:23" />Nambo nhwanamundo Manowa ngannobholila Manowa, “Bhambo Chapanga ngapala kutukoma, ngapokii jhe litambiko lyu kukomelekeya na litambiko lya ukobha, hilu kabhele kututangachila ilebhe yenie kipinde chenje.”<verse eid="JDG 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 13:24" />Peniya nhwanamundo Manowa ngapapa mwana munalome, na Manowa ngantina liina lyake Samusone. Mwana jwenio ngakola na Bhambo Chapanga ngampila mota. <verse eid="JDG 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 13:25" />Uhuke gwa Chapanga ngautumbu kunkokolekeya Samusone kipinde chakibha kukighono cha likabila lya Dane, yane Maane Dane, ikibha pakate jha ku Sola na ku Eshitaole.<verse eid="JDG 13:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JDG 14" />
  <para style="s">Samusone nu munkeghe jwaku Timuna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 14:1" />Lichiko limo Samusone ngahelila kujhenda ku Timuna, kwenio ngammona mwikeghe jhumo, nchikana jwa likabila lya Akafilichite. <verse eid="JDG 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 14:2" />Peniya ngabhujha kajhake kwalobholela tate na majhe mundo, kulonge, “Nimwene kamwale jhumo Mfilichite okwe ku Timuna, mbala undolanikiye.”<verse eid="JDG 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 14:3" />Bhahe, akatate mundo ngabhankonya, “Bho, abhii jhe kamwale kwa akalongo bhino amu mu lukolo lwino ade munkatolele kamwale kwa Akafilichite akahongo abha?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 14:3">Nambo Samusone ngabhajhanguu akatate mundo, “Undolanikiye kamwale jwenio nhwalo andei kunhalalicha hake.”<verse eid="JDG 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 14:4" />Nambo tatemundo na majhe mundo bhakamanyii jhe kilebhe chenio nhwalo mpangu gwenio ndi Bhambo Chapanga kupalaha ndela kwa Samusone kwabula Akafilichite, kipinde chenio Akafilichite bhakibha bhalongwicha kongo bhabhonila kwamakakala aka Ichilahele.<verse eid="JDG 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 14:5" />Peniya Samusone na akatate mundo ngabhajhenda ku Timuna. Pibhaikita pimighonda jha michabibo jha kwenio ku Timuna, kipinde cheche tu litohe lya liimba ngalimpitila Samusone kone lipala kunkachulana. <verse eid="JDG 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 14:6" />Kipinde cheche, Uhuke gwa Chapanga ngaghuntenda Samusone abhe na makakala hake, ngalijwepula liimba lyenio kwa mabhoko ghake jwenio ngita mundo chahanjana litohe lya mbuhe. Samusone ngalongii jhe nhwalo gwenio kwa akatatemundo.<verse eid="JDG 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 14:7" />Peniya Samusone ngahelila kulonge jha kamwale jwenio na kamwale jwenio ngantenda ampale hake Samusone. <verse eid="JDG 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 14:8" />Pighapetita machiko ghandina ngabhujha ku Timuna kuntola kamwale jwenio. Pakibha undela ngabhetukila paupele jha ndela kulola ntuhe ghuliimba lyakomita lela, peniya ngaibhona njuche pamonga na bhuche nkate jha ntuhe. <verse eid="JDG 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 14:9" />Ngakondwila bhuche gwenio kwa mabhoko ghake kongo apeta kulye ngabhajhendela akatatemundo na bhenie hele ngabhape ngabhalye hele nambo alongii jhe kubhehe bhuche gwenio atolita mu ntuhe gwa liimba.<verse eid="JDG 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 14:10" />Tatemundo ngajhenda kajha kwa kamwale jwenio, Samusone ngabheka unyagho kwenio ngita chibhatendita achikangombo kipinde chenie. <verse eid="JDG 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 14:11" />Akafilichite pibhammona Samusone ngabhannete achikangombo makome matato bhabhe pamonga nako. <verse eid="JDG 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 14:12" />Samusone ngabhalobholila, “Nenga naninkonya. Anda nhotaline kulonge mana ghake mu machiko chaba gheniya gha unyagho gwa kuntole kamwale, bhahe, ne naninnetela ngobho makome matato nhuo mbumbumbu na ngobho henge. <verse eid="JDG 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 14:13" />Nambo anda nnepelile kulobho mana ghake, mabhene mipalwa kumbe ne ngobho nhuo mbumbumbu makome matato pamonga na ngobho henge ya unyagho.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 14:13">Peniya ngabhalonge, “Ajha, mutulobhole tujhoe.”<verse eid="JDG 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 14:14" />Samusone ngabhalobholila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 14:14">“Kwa jwalye ngikipita chakulya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 14:14">kwa jhuna makakala ngukupita kunogha.”Ata paipetita machiko matato ingombo yenio bhakahotwi jhe kulonge mana ghake.<verse eid="JDG 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 14:15" />Lichiko lya ncheche ngabhannobholila nhwanamundo Samusone, “Mpembelekeye ungana gwino kupala alonge mana jha luhomo lwenio andajhe natunnyocha mwotu mwenga na nyumba jha tate gwino. Bho, mutukemita kupala kutupoka ilebhe hito?”<verse eid="JDG 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 14:16" />Nhwanamundo Samusone ngannyendila unganamundo kongo abhii mahole chwii kulonge, “Mwe ne umbahi jhe! Mwe mapangii luhomo akakoche bhango, ne unongolii jhe mana ghake.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 14:16">Samusone ngannobholila, “Ne nanchimulile jhe tate gwango ata majhe gwango, nanichimulila bhole mwenga?”<verse eid="JDG 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 14:17" />Na kamwale jwenio ngajhendilila kulela machiko ghoha gha unyagho ghighaighilile. Lichiko lya chaba Samusone nganchimulila nhwanamundo mana jha luhomo lwenio, nhwalo akakwekwelikii hake. Nhwana mundo ngajhenda kajhombe kulonge kwa Akafilichite. <verse eid="JDG 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 14:18" />Lichiko lya chaba lyenio, kabula lyobha nukutipika jhe, ngabhannobholila Samusone,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 14:18">“Nike kinogha ngita bhuche?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 14:18">Kilebhe ghane kina makakala kupeta liimba?”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JDG 14:18">Samusone ngabhalobholela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 14:18">“anda nukutumii jhe ng'ombe jwango kuleme,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 14:18">ngannepelile chukujhanguu ngohe.”<verse eid="JDG 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 14:19" />Papala pala Uhuke gwa Bhambo Chapanga ngughuntenda Samusone kubhehe na makakala, ngajhenda kumuche gwa ku Ashikelone, ngabhakoma bhando makome matato, ngabhahulita ngobho yabhe ya unyagho na kwape bhibhalongii mana gha luhomo lwake. Peniya ngabhoka nu kubhujha kajhake kwa tate mundo na majhe mundo kongo abhii nililaka hake. <verse eid="JDG 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 14:20" />Nambo, nhwana mundo Samusone ngatolina na jhonge kangombo jwannyemilila Samusone paunyagho gwa ndowa.<verse eid="JDG 14:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JDG 15" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 15:1" />Pughapetita machiko ghandina, kipinde cha mahuno gha ngano, Samusone ngatola litohe lya mbuhe, ngajhenda kuntyangii nkohano mundo. Ngannobholila nkohano mundo munalome kubhehe, “Mbala kujhingii kuchumbe cha aanabhango nakabhone.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 15:1">Nambo nkohano mundo ngankanikiya.<verse eid="JDG 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 15:2" />Nkohano mundo munalome ngannobholila, “Nenga ambwika mpala jhe kabhele. Yene nganitolanikicha na nkoche gwino. Ata yene akwete nnung'umundo abhii lembulembu kumpeta jwenio. Chonde muntolele jwenio.” <verse eid="JDG 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 15:3" />Samusone ngalonge, “Mwanja ghongo mbahijhe kukokolekelwa kwa ghala ghimbakwatende Akafilichite.” <verse eid="JDG 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 15:4" />Peniya, Samusone ngajhenda nu kughakamuu mabweya miya tato ngatabha mikela jhabhe pamonga bhabhele bhabhele. Bhahe, ngabheka limbolembole mu mikela jha kila mabweya mabhelemabhele ghighatabhitwe. <verse eid="JDG 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 15:5" />Peniya, ngapamba mambolembole gheniya na ngaghalekekiya mabweya gheniya, ngaghajhingii mu mighonda jha Akafilichite nu kutiniya ngano jhihunitwe na ngano yangaunwa pamonga na mighonda jha micheitune. <verse eid="JDG 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 15:6" />Akafilichite pibhapala kumanya meneke jwatei gheniya, ngabhalobholilwa, “Ndi Samusone, nkohano mundo Ntimuna, ateila gheniya kwa nhwalo nkohano mundo antohi nhwana mundo na kuntolanikicha kwa kangombo jhumo, jwakibha nkoche mundo jwakibha njeche gwake.” Yene, Akafilichite ngabhajhenda kwakoma kwajhocha mwotu mukeghe jwenio pamonga na tatemundo.<verse eid="JDG 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 15:7" />Samusone ngabhalobholila Akafilichite bheniya, “Gheniya ghunteiline ne napii kubhehe nibhoka jhe pamba ade nepechele ghunteile.” <verse eid="JDG 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 15:8" />Peniya Samusone ngabhajhingilila na kwakoma bhando twe hake. Peniya, ngajhenda kutama kulinkwembe lya lighanga likolongwa kweno ku Etamo.<verse eid="JDG 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Samusone abhahoto Akafilichite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 15:9" />Akakomana ngondo bha Akafilichite ngabhaika na kubheka kighono chabhe mu kilambo chuku Yuda ngabhajhenila ade ku muche ghuku Lehi. <verse eid="JDG 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 15:10" />Bhando bhuku Yuda ngabhakonya, “Kilebhe ghane chimutubulila twenga?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 15:10">Akafilichite ngabhajhangwila, “Tuikila kuntabha Samusone nukuntende ngita chatutendii twenga.”<verse eid="JDG 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 15:11" />Peniya, bhando elufo itato bhuku Yuda ngabhanyendilila Samusone kwenio kulinkwembe lyaku Etamo ngabhannobholila, “Bho, umanye kubhehe Akafilichite bhitulongocha twenga? Nnola mabhene uloche ghongo!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 15:11">Samusone ngajhangwila, “Anda chibhandendii na ndi chanatendii nenga.”<verse eid="JDG 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 15:12" />Ngabhannobholila jwenio, “Tuikite kuntabha kupala tunhikiche kwa Akafilichite.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 15:12">Samusone ngalonge, “Nnapila mabhene kubhehe mangota mingoma jhe.”<verse eid="JDG 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 15:13" />Bhene ngabhalongila, “Twenga tunkoma jhe, nambo tupakuntabha tu nukumpeleka kwabhe.” Peniya ngabhantabha ngojhe ibhele nhyono nu kumpiya mwenio mulinkwembe.<verse eid="JDG 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 15:14" />Pibhaikita ku muche gwa ku Lehi, Akafilichite ngabhanyendilila mbelo kone bhichobhela. Kipinde cheche kihuke cha Bhambo Chapanga ngikinhikilila Samusone kwa makakala na ngojhe ikibha bhantabhite mu mabhoko ghake ngitopwika ngita ngobho nhuo chikitinika mwotu na ibatane yenio ngaghagwelila pahe. <verse eid="JDG 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 15:15" />Samusone ngalokwita liupa libhehe li lijhegho lya pahe li liponda na kwabulii bhando na kwakoma bhando elufo jhimo. <verse eid="JDG 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 15:16" />Peniya Samusone ngalonge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 15:16">“Kwaliupa li lijhegho li liponda ngomite bhando elufo jhimo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 15:16">Kwaliupa li lijhegho li liponda, natei kubhehe lilundo ngita maponda ghighawile.”<verse eid="JDG 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 15:17" />Pajhomolila kulonge gheniya, ngataghita liupa lyenio pahe. Chehemo jhenio ngapakemwa Lamate Lehi, mana ghake kitombe chi liupa li lijhegho.<verse eid="JDG 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 15:18" />Peniya Samusone ngabhe na nyota hake. Ngannyopa Bhambo Chapanga, kulonge, “Mwe ma Chapanga, mwenga ndi jhumbila kwahotola. Bho, ngoheno umbakunneka nyomoke kwa nyota nu kutolwa kwa makakala na Akafilichite akahongo bhano?” <verse eid="JDG 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 15:19" />Chapanga ngayekwila libhomba palutope kwenio ku Lehi, mache ngaghapitita. Samusone nganywila mache gheniya na makakala ghake ngaghabhujhilina. Chembwe chenie ngikikemwa Ene Hakole, mana ghake ndi chembwe cha mundo jwakema kupala atangatilwe na chembwe chenie kibhii kwenio ku Lehi ade deleno.<verse eid="JDG 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 15:20" />Yene Samusone ngabhila nkenga jhuku Ichilahele kwa kipinde cha yaka makome mabhele, kipinde chenie Akafilichite bhalongwicha kilambo chenio.<verse eid="JDG 15:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JDG 16" />
  <para style="s">Samusone kumuche gwa Gacha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 16:1" />Lichiko limo Samusone ngajhenda ku muche ghu ku Gacha, ngakongina na nngongola jhumo, ngagholwika nako kelu ndaa. <verse eid="JDG 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 16:2" />Bhando bhu ku Gacha pibhajhoa kubhehe Samusone abhii kwenio, ngabhantindikiya chehemo jhenio nu kunyobhela pannyango nkolongwa gwa kilambo keluu ndaa. Ngibhannyobhila pannyango gwenio kilo jhoha bhahambwika yene, ngabhatama peniya ade pukuchila kupala bhankome. <verse eid="JDG 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 16:3" />Nambo Samusone ngajhendelele kugholoka ade nhwiko. Puhwiko ngajhimuka ngakamwila lifelemo lyoha lya nnyango ghu kilambo, ngajhikwila pamonga na makomeo ghake, ngabhokita nu kujhenda nako ade pa kitombe pahina nu ku Ebulone.<verse eid="JDG 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Delila innyambii Samusone</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 16:4" />Pughapetita gheniya, Samusone ngang'anita mwikeghe jhumo liina lyake Delila, jwatamita muling'engo lyaku Soleki. <verse eid="JDG 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 16:5" />Akanahota akakolongwa nhwano bha Akafilichite ngabhanyendilila Delila nu kunnobholela, “Mpembelekeye Samusone ade mmanye chile jha makakala ghake twe, kupala tumpukile nukuntabha. Anda ntei yenie, kila mundo pakate jhito nampela ipande elufo jhimo na miya jhimo ya madine gha feza.”<verse eid="JDG 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 16:6" />Delila ngannobholila Samusone, “Chonde, unnobholele chile jha makakala ghino, na mundo ipalwa atenda bhole, ade kunhotola nuku ntabha pyee?”<verse eid="JDG 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 16:7" />Samusone ngannyangwila, “Anda bhandabhite kwa ngojhe chaba mbehe yupende, mbakubhe naleghalabho ngita bhange bhando.”<verse eid="JDG 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 16:8" />Ilongoche ya Akafilichite ngabhannetila Delila ngojhe yenie chaba mbehe yu pende na Delila ngantabha ngojhe yenio Samusone pyee. <verse eid="JDG 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 16:9" />Delila akibha bhabhekite bhando bhannyobhele Samusone kuchumbe chenge. Peniya ngankema Samusone kanonoya, “Samusone! Akafilichite bhitenda kuika!” Samuone ngatopwila ngojhe yene ngita luche ya litonje pulunywimwu mwotu. Akibha jhe mundo jwahotwii kumanya chile jha makakala ghake.<verse eid="JDG 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 16:10" />Delila ngannobholila Samusone, “Mwe undendii ubhiche, ntei kungolowa. Chonde unnobholele chikipalwa kuntabha nganganga mwenga.”<verse eid="JDG 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 16:11" />Samusone ngajhanguu, “Anda bhandabhite kwa ngojhe nhyono yangatumbu kutumika mbakubhe naleghelebho ngita mundo jhojhoha.”<verse eid="JDG 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 16:12" />Peniya, Delila ngatola ngojhe nhyono, ngantabha Samusone. Kubhoke peniya Delila ngankema kulilobhe likolongwa, “Samusone! Akafilichite bhitenda kuika kunyingilila!” Kipinde cheche bhando bhateila kunnyobhela kuchumbi chenge. Samusone ngatopwila ngojhe yenio ngita luche.<verse eid="JDG 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 16:13" />Delila ngannobholila Samusone, “Ade ngohe undende ubhiche, undenda kungolowa!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 16:13">Samusone ngannobholila, “Anda nchukite nyenja chaba ya majhunjo ghango mulutando lwa ngobho nukubhehe nganganga munng'omba gwapumbache ghukukobeke ngobho, mbakubhe naleghelabho ngita bhange bhando.”<verse eid="JDG 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 16:14" />Samusone pakibha mulughono Delila ngaichuka pamonga nyenja ya majhunjo gha Samusone ngaitabha mulutando lwa ngobho nganganga mpumbache. Peniya ngannobholila Samusone, “Samusone! Akafilichite bhitenda kuika kunnyingilila.” Samusone ngajhimuka mulughono ngajhikwila mpumbache gwenio nukujwepula lutando lwa ngobho yenio.<verse eid="JDG 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 16:15" />Delila ngannobholila Samusone, “Mwe mihoto bhole kulonge mimbala nakongo minongole jhe chile jhino? Undende ubhiche mala patato. Ade ngohe unongilii jhe chile jha makakala ghino.” <verse eid="JDG 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 16:16" />Delila ngajhendilila kunghaghalila hake Samusone ku malobhe twe kila lichiko, ade ngatotokila umwojho papipi nu kuwe, <verse eid="JDG 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 16:17" />akahotwi jhe kuimbilila Samusone ngalonge hotuhotu chile jhake, “Majhunjo ghango ghinachekulilwa jhe. Nenga mbangitwe na Chapanga kubhoke mulutumbo lwa majhe gwango. Anda njekwii majhunjo ghango, makakala ghango naghabhoka namma ngita mundo jhojhoha.”<verse eid="JDG 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 16:18" />Delila pamanya kubhehe Samusone alongii chile jhake jhoha, ngabhakengima ilongoche ya Akafilichite ngabhalobholila, “Nhwikengane kabhele mwanja ghongo nhwalo Samusone anongolile hotuhotu chile jhake ilongoche ya Akafilichite ngabhanyendila Delila kongo bhajheghite feza ibhannaghila.” <verse eid="JDG 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 16:19" />Na Delila ngantenda Samusone aghoche lughono pamajhogha ghake, ngankema mundo anchekule nyenja chaba ya majhunjo ghake. Peniya Delila ngatumbu kunchumbua Samusone kupala ajhimuke nambo Samusone akibhajhe na makakala kabhena. <verse eid="JDG 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 16:20" />Delila ngannobholila Samusone, “Samusone! Akafilichite bhitenda kuika kunnyingilila!” Samusone ngajhimuka mulughono ahambwika kubhehe ngita makacho. Amanyii jhe kubhehe Bhambo Chapanga akibha annekite. <verse eid="JDG 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 16:21" />Akafilichite ngabhampukila, ngabhantochwila miho ghake, ngabhampelika ku Gacha, kwenio ngabhantabha pingo jha shaba, na kunchokolekeya kuhenga lihengo likuyagha ngano mukipungo. <verse eid="JDG 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 16:22" />Nambo majhunjo ghake ngaghatumbu kukola kabhele kubhoke pukuchekula.<verse eid="JDG 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuwe kwa Samusone</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 16:23" />Ilongoche ya Akafilichite ngabhakongana pamonga kupala kuina unyagho gwaku nnomba chapanga jwabhe jwakemitwa Daghone. Peniya ngabhajhemba, “Chapanga gwito atutehi tunhotole likoko gwito Samusone.” <verse eid="JDG 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 16:24" />Bhando pibhammona Samusone ngabhannomba chapanga jwabhe Daghone kulonge, “Chapanga gwito atutehi tunhotole likoko gwito Samusone, jwakihangabhina kilambo chito na kwakoma bhando bhito ndi.” <verse eid="JDG 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 16:25" />Pibhahanganila kumwojho hake, ngabhalonge, “Munnete Samusone atei tuhangane kumwojho.” Peniya ngabhampiya Samusone mukipungo, ngabhanneta na jwenio ngakinita palonge jhabhe. Ngabhammeka panakate jha heke. <verse eid="JDG 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 16:26" />Samusone ngannobholila kangombo jwantandiya, “Uneke mbapaye heke ya nyumba jhenje kupala kujheghemela.” <verse eid="JDG 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 16:27" />Peniya, nyumba jhenie ikibha ihindimine bhando akanalome na akakeghe. Na ilongoche bhoha ya Akafilichite bhakibha mwenio na padale pakibha na bhando elufo itato akanalome na akakeghe, bhannolokiya Samusone akaina.<verse eid="JDG 16:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 16:28" />Peniya Samusone ngannyopa Bhambo Chapanga, “Bhambo Chapanga ninnyopa ungomboke. Umbe makakala kipinde chenje tugha, chonde Bhambo, kupala nalepechele kwa Akafilichite bheniya bhaghatuchwii miho ghango.” <verse eid="JDG 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 16:29" />Samusone ngaikamu heke yoha ibhele ya panakate ndi ikamulila nyumba jhenio. Ngabheka lubhoko lumo kongo na longe kongo. <verse eid="JDG 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 16:30" />Ngalonge, “Nhwe tugha pamonga na Akafilichite.” Ngatenwila kwa makakala ghake ghoha. Lijhumba lyenie ngilyatenwikila ilongoche yoha ya Akafilichite bhibhakibha mulijhumba lyenie. Yene ngabhakoma bhando twe kipinde chenio kupeta pakoma kipinde cha ughome gwake.<verse eid="JDG 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 16:31" />Akahacha mundo pamonga na akalongo mundo ngabhaika kuntola, ngabhanchika panakate jhi kilambo chuku Sola na kilambo chuku Eshitaole umambe jha Manowa, tatemundo. Samusone akibha kilongoche jwaku Ichilahele kwa kipinde cha yaka makome mabhele.<verse eid="JDG 16:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JDG 17" />
  <para style="s">Inyagho ya Mika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 17:1" />Kipinde chenio pakibha na mundo jhumo jwa kilambo chu itombe ya ku Efulaimo, liina lyake Mika. <verse eid="JDG 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 17:2" />Lichiko limo ngannobholila majhe mundo, “Majhe nganyoina munnapanikiye jwannyibhila ipande elufo jhimo na miya jhimo ya madine gha feza ijhibhitwa, madine gheniya ghabhii nanenga, dola nakatoi nenga.” Nenga ndi jhungwatwila.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 17:2">Majhe mundo ngannobholila, “Mwanango, Bhambo Chapanga ampe mota, nhwalo nnongi chakaka.”<verse eid="JDG 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 17:3" />Mika ngamujhichila majhe mundo ipande ya madine gha feza elufo jhimo na miya jhimo na majhe ngalongila, “Kulapii kunapile kwangampata jhe, ipande yenie nibheka kubhehe ya Bhambo Chapanga na peniya kutendekeya kinyagho chukubhacha nu kukilima madine gha feza kunhwalo gwino. Deleno ngita nimujhichila mwenga madine gheniya gha feza.” <verse eid="JDG 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 17:4" />Mika ngamujhichila majhe mundo ipande ya madine gheniya, majhemundo ghapokila ipande miya ibhele ya madine gheniya na ngampila yukubhacha inyagho cha nkongo, ngakilima madine gha feza gheniya. Kinyagho chenio ngakibhekwa munyumba jha Mika.<verse eid="JDG 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 17:5" />Mika akibha na chehemo jhake jhukunyinamii ichapanga. Ngatendikiya kichibao cha mpiya litambiko pamonga na inyagho ichapanga, peniya ngammeka mwana mundo jhumo munalome kubhehe mpiya litambiko gwake. <verse eid="JDG 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 17:6" />Machiko gheniya pakibha jhe munahota nkolongwa pakilambo chuku Ichilahele. Yene kila mundo ngatenda chochoha chakipala jwenio.<verse eid="JDG 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 17:7" />Kipinde cheche pakibha na kangombo jhumo Nnabhe, kubomane ku Betelehemo kukilambo chuku Yuda. <verse eid="JDG 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 17:8" />Kangombo jwenio ngabhoka ku Betelehemo, kukilambo chuku Yuda ngajhenda kupalaha chehemo jhenge pukutama. Mukutyanga kwake ngaika pakajhake Mika, kukilambo chuku itombe yuku Efulaimo. <verse eid="JDG 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 17:9" />Mika ngankonya, “Mwe, mihumii koo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 17:9">Na jwenio ngajhanguu, “Nenga Nalabhe, nihumii kumuche gwa Betelehemo kukilambo chuku Yuda. Nipalaha chehemo jhu kutama.”<verse eid="JDG 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 17:10" />Mika ngannobholila, “Ntame pamonga na nenga mma ngita matate na mapiya litambiko bhango, nannimpela ipande kome ya madine gha feza kila chaka pamonga na ngobho na kila chimighana.” <verse eid="JDG 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 17:11" />Kangombo jwenio Nnabhe ngajheketila kutama na Mika nu kubhehe ngita jhumo ya yana ya Mika. <verse eid="JDG 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 17:12" />Mika ngampila mota kangombo jwenio kubhehe mpiya litambiko gwake, na ngatama kajha kwa Mika. <verse eid="JDG 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 17:13" />Peniya, Mika ngalonge, “Ngohe manye kubhehe Bhambo Chapanga atendii ghambone, nhwalo ambii kangombo hojho Nnabhe abhe mpiya litambiko gwango.”<verse eid="JDG 17:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JDG 18" />
  <para style="s">Mika na bhando bha likabila lya Dane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 18:1" />Machiko gheniya pakibha jhe na munahota nkolongwa mu kilambo chuku Ichilahele. Yene bhando bha likabila lya Dane ngalipaliya chehemo jhake jhukutama mu kilambo chenio, nhwalo ade machiko gheniya, likabila lya Dane lipaliya chehemo jhabhe pakate jha makabila ghaku Ichilahele. <verse eid="JDG 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 18:2" />Yene bhando bha likabila lya Dane ngabhahagwila bhando panakate jhabhe bhangajhoghopa, ngabhatuma akakomana ngondo nhwano kubhoka kwenio ku Sola nu ku Eshitaole ngabhalaghila bhajhende bhakakiingukiye kilambo. Na bhando bheniya ngabhajhenda kuilambo ibhii na itombe yuku Efulaimo, kajhake Mika ngabhatama kwenio. <verse eid="JDG 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 18:3" />Pibhaika kajhake Mika, ngabhalimanya lilobhe lya kangombo Nnawe. Ngabhannyendilaa nukunkonya, “Gwe annetite ghane kongone? Mihenga lihengo ghane kongone?”<verse eid="JDG 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 18:4" />Jwenio ngabhajhangwila, “Mika alaghine kilebhe nanenga, ambekii mme nampiya litambiko jwake.”<verse eid="JDG 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 18:5" />Na bhene ngabhalonge, “Chonde mutukonyekeye kwa Chapanga anda mwanja gwito ghone natupata chitupala.”<verse eid="JDG 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 18:6" />Peniya mpiya litambiko jwenio ngabhalobholila, “Nnyende kwa uteeke. Bhambo Chapanga abhii kulolela kupata chimighana.”<verse eid="JDG 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 18:7" />Bhando bheniya nhwano ngabhajhenda ku Laishi. Ngabhabhona bhando bhibhatama kwenio na pibhatama kwa uteeke ngita bhando bhuku Chidone. Bhakibha bhando bhanuu na bhangakiholo, kabhele chaobhita jhe kilebhe chochoha, ibhaipalita yoha ikibha mu kilambo chabhe. Kabhele bhakibha kutale na bhando bhuku Chidone na bhakibha jhe lihengo na bhange bhando. <verse eid="JDG 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 18:8" />Bhahe, akalingukii bheniya ngabhabhujha kakalongo bhabhe kukilambo chuku Sola nuku Eshitaole. Bheniya ngabhakonya, “Mukibhwene kilebhe ghane kwenio.” <verse eid="JDG 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 18:9" />Bhene ngabhajhangwila, “Jhinuka tujhende tukabule bhando bhikilambo chenje, chakaka kilambo chenio kihalii hake kulema nu kukoleka. Bho, mitama pamba tu changahenga lihengo? Mangabhe jhe nikiyoto kujhenda kukitenda kilambo chenie kibhehe chito. <verse eid="JDG 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 18:10" />Pumpakuika kwenio namakolela bhando bhangakiholo chochoha. Kilambo chenio kikolongwa, kibhii jhe kilebhe chochoha chikipungokiwe na Chapanga antangatile kutola kilambo chenie.”<verse eid="JDG 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 18:11" />Bhahe, bhando miya chita bha likabila lya Dane kongo bhabhii na chilaha yabhe ya ngondo, ngabhabhoka ku Sola nu ku Eshitaole kujhenda kukomana ngondo. <verse eid="JDG 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 18:12" />Ngabhajhenda kubheka kighono chabhe okwe Kiliate Yealimo mu kilambo chuku Yuda. Ndi nhwalo upande gwenio kulitipikii lyobha gwa Kiliate Yealimo pikemwa Mahane Dane yane kighono chu ku Dane ade deleno. <verse eid="JDG 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 18:13" />Kubhoka kwenio ngabhajhenda kukilambo chuku itombe yuku Efulaimo, kajhake Mika.<verse eid="JDG 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 18:14" />Bhando nhwano bheniya ngibhajhenda kuilingukii kilambo chuku Laishi ngabhalobholila akalongomundo kubhehe, “Bho, umanye kubhehe pakate jha majhumba agha kibhii kizibao na inyagho yukajha na kinyagho chukubhacha chibhakilime madine gha feza? Na helahela ibhii inyagho henge ichapanga. Naumanya mabhene nantenda bhole.” <verse eid="JDG 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 18:15" />Peniya akalingukii bheniya ngabhajhenda ukajha kwa Mika, ngabhajhingii nkate nukunkonyekeya nhwalo gwa kangombo jwa likabila lya Lawe. <verse eid="JDG 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 18:16" />Kipinde chenio bhando miya chita bha likabila lya Dane bhibhakibha na chilaha yabhe ya ngondo bhakajhemite pannyango nkolongwa gwa muche. <verse eid="JDG 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 18:17" />Bhando nhwano bheniya bhibhajhenda kulingukiya kilambo bhala ngabhajhingii nkate unyumba, ngabhatola kinyagho kubhacha na kizibao pamonga na inyagho henge ichapanga. Kipinde chenio mpiya litambiko jwenio akibha ajhemite pannyango pamonga na bhando miya chita bhina chilaha ya ngondo.<verse eid="JDG 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 18:18" />Mpiya litambiko jhola ngabhabhona akalingukii bhakajhingila unyumba jha Mika nu kutola kinyagho chukubhacha pamonga na kihukilo chukunkonyela ghapala Chapanga na kinyagho chukuyana, jwenio ngabhakonya, “Nike mihenga?”<verse eid="JDG 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 18:19" />Bhene ngabhajhangwila, “Nkotoke, nhumbate nnomo gwino, nnyende pamonga na twenga, mme mapiya litambiko bhito na ngita matate bhito na mpiya litambiko gwito. Amu mwe milola bho? Mwe nnola kilebhe chambone kubhe mapiya litambiko bhi likabila limo amu kubhehe mapiya litambiko bhi likabila lyoha lya Ichilahele?” <verse eid="JDG 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 18:20" />Mpiya litambiko jwenio ngahekalila hake, ngatola kihukilo na kinyagho chenio, pamonga na ichapanga yukuyana, ngajhenda nabho.<verse eid="JDG 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 18:21" />Bhahe, ngabhabhoka ku muche gwa Mika ngabhajhendelila na mwanja gwabhe. Kone ngabhailongwicha yana na ipugho yabhe pamonga na ilebhe yabhe yoha. <verse eid="JDG 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 18:22" />Pibhaika kutale na nyumba jha Mika, Mika ngamanya kubhehe ilebhe itoilwe, yene ngabhakemita bhando bhake bhibhakibha pahina na ngabhakongina pamonga, ngabhakengima bhando bhi likabila lya Dane ngabhakolela. <verse eid="JDG 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 18:23" />Peniya, ngabhachobhalila, na bhando bha likabila lya Dane ngabhaghalambukila nu ngabhankonya Mika, “Bho, nnolite kilebhe ghane ade kutukema nilinchambe ngita lende?”<verse eid="JDG 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 18:24" />Mika ngalonge, “Mangota ntolingine ichapanga yango jhindengeniche namwete, kabhele mutoii mpiya litambiko jwango, ngauneka changakilebhe chochoha. Ngohe mingonya mmi na malola ghane?”<verse eid="JDG 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 18:25" />Bhando bha likabila lya Dane ngabhannobholila, “Mbaha maghaleke mayele ghino, amu bhange pakate jhito bhina lilaka bhahoto kumbula, namwe mihoto kuhobheya ghome gwino na ghome gwa akalongo bhino.” <verse eid="JDG 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 18:26" />Mika palolita bhampetite makakala ngabhatabhuka ngabhujha kajhake, na bhando bha likabila lya Dane ngabhajhendilila na mwanja gwabhe.<verse eid="JDG 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 18:27" />Bhando bheniya bha likabila lya Dane ngabhatola ilebhe yoha ya Mika yatendikiya jwene, ngabhantola na mpiya litambiko jwakibha antumikila Mika. Peniya ngabhajhenda kukijhingilila kilambo chuku Laishi na kwakoma bhando bha kwenio bhibhakibha bhatamita kwa uteeke na changakiholo, na ngabhatiniya kila kilebhe mu kilambo chenio. <verse eid="JDG 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 18:28" />Bhando bha kilambo chenio bhakibha jhe na mundo jwakwaghombola nhwalo bhakibha kutale na ku muche gwaku Chidone, kabhele bhakibha jhe na akakoche na bhando bhange kupala bhatangatilwe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 18:28">Kilambo chenio kikibha chehemo jhululambo lwa Bete Leobo. Bhando bha likabila lya Dane ngabhachenga kabhele kilambo chenio nu kutama mwenio. <verse eid="JDG 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 18:29" />Ngabhaghalambwiya liina lya muche gwa Dane, ngabhakema liina lya okomundo jwakibha mwana jwa Yakobu helahela akemitwa Ichilahele. Nambo kilambo chenio makacho kikemitwa Laishi. <verse eid="JDG 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 18:30" />Bhando bha likabila lya Dane ngabhajhemika kinyagho chukubhacha, Yonathane mwana jwa Gelishomu, nchokolo jwa Mucha, ngabhe mpiya litambiko jwabhe. Ibheluko yabhe helahela ngabhila ipiya litambiko ya likabila lya Dane ade bhando bha kilambo chenio pibhatoilwa kujhenda kuluamo ku Babeli. <verse eid="JDG 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 18:31" />Kipinde choha Lihema lya kuntumikila Bhambo Chapanga pikibha ku Shilo, bhando bha likabila lya Dane bhakibha bhajhendilila kuitumikila inyagho yu kubhacha ya Mika.<verse eid="JDG 18:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JDG 19" />
  <para style="s">Nnawe na kilaghe chake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 19:1" />Machiko gheniya ku Ichilahele pakibha jhe na munahota nkolongwa, pakibha na Nnawe jhumo jwatamita ngita nng'ene kutale pikilambo chiitombe ya ku Efulaimo. Mundo jwenio ngatola kilaghe ku Betelehemo ku kilambo chuku Yuda. <verse eid="JDG 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 19:2" />Nambo kilaghe chenio nganchimwa Nnawe jwenio, nganneka nukujhende kajhake kwa tate mundo ku Betelehemo, kwenio mwikeghe jwenio ngatama myehe ncheche. <verse eid="JDG 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 19:3" />Lichiko limo nnganamundo ngatola ntumiche jwake na maponda mabhele nu kujhenda ku Betelehemo. Ajhenda kulonge nako kunnyopa abhujhe bhatame nako kabhele. Mwikeghe jwenio nganneka nkate mwa tate mundo, nkohanomundo palola ngampokela kukuhengwa mwojho. <verse eid="JDG 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 19:4" />Nkohanomundo ngampokila, peniya ngatama kwenio kwa machiko matato, Nnawe jwenio pamonga na ntumiche jwake ngabhalila nu kunywelekeya ngabhagholwika kweno. <verse eid="JDG 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 19:5" />Lichiko lya ncheche ngabhajhimwika putepute, ngabhakilenganikiya kwa mwanja, nambo tate jwa mwikeghe jwenio ngannobholila, “Nnabhuke hote nkola makakala kubhoka peniya nnyendangane.”<verse eid="JDG 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 19:6" />Bhahe, bhando bhabhele bheniya ngabhatama, ngabhalila nu kunywelekeya pamonga. Peniya nkohanomundo ngannobholila, “Chonde nng'oloke pamba kilo jhenje nu kukihanganila.”<verse eid="JDG 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 19:7" />Nnawe jwenio pajhinwika kupala kubhoka, nkohanomundo ngampembilikiya atame, jwenio ngaighala. <verse eid="JDG 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 19:8" />Lichiko li nhwano nnabhe jwenio ngajhimwika putepute, kupala ajhende. Nambo tatemundo mwikeghe jwenio ngannobholila, “Nkomalile hote nkola makakala, peniya nnenda lyobha lihenamuka nnyenda.” Bhoha bhabhele ngabhajhenda kulye pamonga.<verse eid="JDG 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 19:9" />Nnawe jwenio pamonga na kilaghe chake na ntumiche jwake pibhajhemita kupala kujhenda, nkohanomundo ngannobholila Nnawe jwenio, “Ngohe mui ujhomwokile na kimiye kibhandikile. Nng'oloke pamba kukukihanga. Kilabho putepute ntumbula mwanja gwino ghukukelebhuka kajhino.”<verse eid="JDG 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 19:10" />Nambo nnabhe jwenio ngakana kugholoka kwenio kilo jhenio. Bhahe, ngajhema kubhoka ngaika pahina nu kubomane ku Yebuse, liina lenge Yeluchalemo. Akibha na maponda ghake mabhele ghighatandikwe, kabhele akibha pamonga na kilaghe chake. <verse eid="JDG 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 19:11" />Pibhabhandikila kukilambo chiku Yebuse, lichiko libhandikila kujhomoka, ntumiche ngannobholila munahota gwake, “Ngohe mbaha tujhingii mu kilambo cha aka Yebuse tugholoke mwenio kilo jhenje.”<verse eid="JDG 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 19:12" />Munahota gwake nganyangwila, “Tujhigha jhe kujhingii mu kilambo cha akaghene bhangabhe aka Ichilahele. Tujhendelele na mwanja ade ku Gebeya. <verse eid="JDG 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 19:13" />Tughaghe tukagholoke ku Gebeya amu ku Lama.” <verse eid="JDG 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 19:14" />Bhahe, ngabhajhendilila na mwanja ade lyobha pilitipika ngabhabhe pahina nu kuika ku Gebeya, kilambo cha likabila lya aka Benjamine. <verse eid="JDG 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 19:15" />Ngabhajhingila pabomane kupala kugholoka peniya kilo. Pibhaika pabomane ngabhajhenda kutama pikibhanja cha pabomane pakongoloo, nhwalo akibhajhe mundo jwabhapokile pakajhake.<verse eid="JDG 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 19:16" />Pibhakibha peniya, okolo jhumo ngaika pena ahumila kung'onda gwake. Hokolo jwenio akibha nkolo kilambo cha itombe yuku Efulaimo na atamita ku Gebeya ngita nng'ene. Akolo kilambo bhuku Gebeya bhakibha bha likabila lya Benjamine. <verse eid="JDG 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 19:17" />Hokolo jwenio palola nu kummona mundo jwenio abhii kwenio kukibhanja, ngankonya, “Gwe, mibhoka kojhe na mijhenda koo?”<verse eid="JDG 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 19:18" />Nnawe jwenio ngajhangwila, “Tuhumita ku Betelehemo kukilambo chuku Yuda na tujhenda kutale kuilambo ina itombe yuku Efulaimo. Kwenio ndi kunitama na ngohe nikelebhuka ku Betelehemo yuku Yuda, mujha ukajha apitii jhe mundo jwambokile pamba kujhenda kajhake. <verse eid="JDG 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 19:19" />Nambo tukwete kila kilebhe, twe akatumiche bhino tubhii na manyahe ghukulye maponda ghito. Helahela tubhii na mabumunda na divaye yukulye nenga na kilaghe chango na ntumiche jwango.”<verse eid="JDG 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 19:20" />Hokolo jwenio ngannobholila, “Uteeke ubhaha na mangotamwe, eghelela pakajhango! Ne nanimpela kilebhe chochoha chimipala. Nambo mangagholoka jhe palubhanja pano.” <verse eid="JDG 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 19:21" />Yene, hokolo jwenio ngabhapelika kajhake na ngaghapila maponda gheniya manyahe ghukulye. Na bheniya ngabhapila mache ghukukuwa makongono ngabhalila nu kunywelekeya.<verse eid="JDG 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 19:22" />Pibhakibha bhikihangana mwojho, papa tu akangongola bhapabomane ngabhaika nukuitindii nyumba jhenio nukukong'onda nnyango kanonoo. Ngabhannobholila hokolo nkolo nyumba, “Mupiye panja munalome jwaiki pamba tupala kugholoka nako.”<verse eid="JDG 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 19:23" />Nambo hokolo jwenio nkolo nyumba ngapita panja, ngalonge, “Yene jhe akalongo bhango, ne ndenda kunnyopa mangatenda jhe ubhoho gwenio. Ojho nng'ene jwango, mangatenda jhe kilebhe chahone chenio. <verse eid="JDG 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 19:24" />Pamba ngwete nchikana jwangammanya munalome helahela abhi kilaghe cha nng'ene jwenio nanapiya panja matola bheniya matendela chimikipala, nambo mundo ojho mangantendela jhe kilebhe chochoha changanandela ngita chenio.” <verse eid="JDG 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 19:25" />Nambo akanalome bheniya bhakannyokanikii jhe. Nambo Nnawe jwenio ngakipiya kilaghe chake chela ngabhakamwiya na akanalome bheniya ngabhantola, ngabhannimba kelu ndaa pahina nukuchegha ngabhanneka ajhende.<verse eid="JDG 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 19:26" />Lukela putepute mwikeghe jwenio ngakwabhila kubhujha ade pannyango gwa nyumba jhabhii unganamundo, ngagwila pahe nu kutama ade pukuchila. <verse eid="JDG 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 19:27" />Unganamundo pajhimwika lukela, ngajhogwila milyango jha nyumba ngapita panja kupala bhajhendele na mwanja. Kukuchitukila ngakibhona kilaghe chake kigholwike pannyango, mabhoko ghake ghakamulii nkolokote gwa nnyango. <verse eid="JDG 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 19:28" />Ngalonge, “Nnyinuke tujhende.” Nambo jwenio ajhangwii jhe kilebhe. Ngantola nukuobhokeya muliponda lyake nukumpeleka kajhake. <verse eid="JDG 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 19:29" />Paikita kajhake, ngatola kihembe nukunheketana ipande kome na ibhele. Kila kipande chimo ngapelika mu kila likabila lya ku Ichilahele. <verse eid="JDG 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 19:30" />Bhando bhoha bhibhalolita kilebhe chenio ngabhalonge, “Oko! Kilebhe kibhoho ngita chenje tunakibhona jhe kutumbulii putubhoka kukilambo chuku Michile ade ngohe! Tukiwachii, tulonge pamonga natutenda bhole?”<verse eid="JDG 19:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JDG 20" />
  <para style="s">Akaichilahele bhikilenganikiya kwa ngondo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 20:1" />Bhando bhoha bhuku Ichilahele, kuhumi kila chehemo ngabhahika ku Dane ade kachekachine jhiku Bele Sheba, pamonga na bhando bhikilambo chuku Geleade, bhando bhoha ngabhakongana ku Misipa nu kubhehe kilebhe chimo, nnonge jha Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="JDG 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 20:2" />Ilongoche yoha ya makabila ghuku Ichilahele ngabhaika nnonge jha ngongano jha bhando bha Chapanga. Akakomana ngondo bhina chilaha bhakibha lake ncheche. <verse eid="JDG 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 20:3" />Na bheniya bhando bhoha bha likabila lya Benjamine, ngabhajhoha kubhehe Akaichilahele bhange bhakonganike ku Misipa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 20:3">Akaichilahele ngabhankonya munalome jwenio, Nnawe, “Mutulobholele ubhoho gwenio utendika bhole?”<verse eid="JDG 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 20:4" />Nnawe jwenio, munalome jwa kilaghe ngajhangwila, “Nenga pamonga na kilaghe chango ngutuika kukilambo chuku Gebeya, kilambo cha likabila lya Benjamine kupala tugholoke peniya kilo. <verse eid="JDG 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 20:5" />Nambo bhando bhikilambo chuku Gebeya ngabhaika kilo kunnyingilii nenga ngibhiitindila nyumba jhinikibha ng'olwike. Bhapata kungoma, ngibhikilimba kilaghe chango ade kuwegha. <verse eid="JDG 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 20:6" />Ne ngandohila ntuhe gwake ngahekitina ipande nukupeleka kukila likabila lya Akaichilahele kipande chimo. Mana bhateii kilebhe cha hone chikipalwajhe na ukokotoko pi Ichilahele. <verse eid="JDG 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 20:7" />Ngohe mangota Makaichilahele nnongela na mpiya luhadabulo lwino.”<verse eid="JDG 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 20:8" />Bhando bhoha kwa lilobhe limo ngabhajhema nu kulonge, “Abhii jhe mundo pakate jhito jwapakubhujha ku lihema lyake amu kajhake. <verse eid="JDG 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 20:9" />Yene ndi chitupakutenda kunhwalo gwa bhando bhuku Gebeya. Tutenda kiumbuumbu nnobhole kupala twamanye likabila lilipakujhenda kwabula. <verse eid="JDG 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 20:10" />Twahaghuu bhando kome kila pakate jha bhando miya jhimo bha Akaichilahele, bhando miya jhimo kila pakate jha bhando elufo jhimo, bhando elufo jhimo kila pakate jha bhando elufo kome. Bheniya bhibha nilihengo lya kwalete chakulya ajhabhe bhibhabhii nilihengo lya kwahadabuu bhando bhuku Gebeya kilambo chuku Benjamine kwa ubhoho gwabhe ghubhatei pikilambo chuku Ichilahele.” <verse eid="JDG 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 20:11" />Yene akakomana ngondo bhoha bhuku Ichilahele ngabhakongana pamonga kwajhingilii bhando kumuche gwa ku Gebeya.<verse eid="JDG 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 20:12" />Bhando bha makabila ghuku Ichilahele ngabhatuma bhando kujhenda kila chehemo pighabhii makabila gha Benjamine kulonge, “Bho, ubhoho ghane ghongo ghunteilingine ajhito? <verse eid="JDG 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 20:13" />Ngohe mutulobholele bhando bhibhateii ubhoho nkolongwa ghongo pikilambo chuku Gebeya kupala twakome nu kukomelekeya njwenjwe pa Ichilahele pano.” Nambo bhando bha likabila lya Benjamine bhakajhokanikii jhe akalongo mundo Akaichilahele. <verse eid="JDG 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 20:14" />Nambo bheniya ngabhabhoka ku miche jhabhe yoha ya Benjamine nukongana ku Gebeya, kupala kubulana na bhando bhuku Ichilahele. <verse eid="JDG 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 20:15" />Bhando bhi likabila lya Benjamine ngabhakonganicha akakomana ngondo elufo ichiline na chita kubhoka mu miche jhabhe bhukuhoto kutumi upanga, na ajhito akolo kilambo bhuku Gebeya ngabhakonganicha bhando miya chaba bhangajhoghopa ngondo. <verse eid="JDG 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 20:16" />Pakate jha akakomana ngondo bheniya bhoha, bhakibha akakomana ngondo miya chaba bhibhatumii lubhoko lwangejha. Bheniya bhakibha kila mundo jwahoto kutumii ngumbelo nu kupema lijhunjo pangakotowa. <verse eid="JDG 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 20:17" />Akaichilahele changabhalangila likabila lya Akabenjamine, ngabhakonganicha bhando lake ncheche bhibhamanye kutumii chilaha, bhoha bhakibha bhangajhoghopa mungondo.<verse eid="JDG 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngondo pakate jha Akaichilahele na Akabenjamine</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 20:18" />Akachilahele ngabhajhenda ku Betele chehemo pukunnyinamii Chapanga, kupala bhamanye likabila lyakujhenda kutumbuu kubulana ni likabila lya aka Benjamine.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 20:18">Bhambo Chapanga ngalijhanguu, “Likabila lya Yuda litumbule.”<verse eid="JDG 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 20:19" />Peniya aka Ichilahele ngibhalabha lukela lichiko lilikengima kujhenda kubheka kighono chabhe pahina na muche gwa ku Gebeya. <verse eid="JDG 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 20:20" />Akaichilahele ngabhajhenda kubulana na bhando bha likabila lya Benjamine, ngaleganikiya akakomana ngondo bhabhe kila jhumo ngajhema chehemo jhake kubulana kwenio ku muche gwa ku Gebeya. <verse eid="JDG 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 20:21" />Bhando bha likabila lya Benjamine ngabhapita panja jha muche gwa ku Gebeya ngabhabulana na aka Ichilahele, ngabhakoma bhando bhuku Ichilahele elufo ichiline niibhele lichiko lyenio. <verse eid="JDG 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 20:22" />Nambo aka Ichilahele ngabhakwimichina miojho, ngabhakilenganikiya kabhele kwa ngondo chehemo jhela pibhajhemita makacho. <verse eid="JDG 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 20:23" />Kabula jha gheniya, aka Ichilahele ngabhajhenda chehemo jhukunnyinamila nukupipikiya nnonge jha Bhambo Chapanga ade kimiye. Peniya ngabhajhopa kujheketelwa na Bhambo nukonya, “Bho, kabhele tujhenda kubulana na akalongo bhito bha likabila lya Benjamine?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 20:23">Bhambo Chapanga ngajhangwila,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 20:23">“Ajha, nnyendengane makakomane nabho.”<verse eid="JDG 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 20:24" />Yene lichiko lyubhele aka Ichilahele ngabhabhandikila pahina kubulana na bhando bha likabila lya Benjamine. <verse eid="JDG 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 20:25" />Lichiko lyenio bhando bha likabila lya Benjamine ngabhabhoka ku Gebeya na kwajhingilii aka Ichilahele ajhabhe, ngabhakomita akakomana ngondo bhu ku Ichilahele elufo kome na nane, bhibhamanye kubulana. <verse eid="JDG 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 20:26" />Bhando bhoha bha akakomana ngondo bha aka Ichilahele bhibhaighilii ngabhajhenda kumuche gwa ku Betele. Lichiko lyenio ngabhapipikiya kwenio mukunnelela Bhambo Chapanga pamonga nukupunga ade kimiye. Ngabhapangii Bhambo Chapanga matambiko ghukukomelekeya na matambiko gha uteeke. <verse eid="JDG 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 20:27" />Akaichilahele ngabhannyopa Bhambo Chapanga bhape malango kwenio ku Betele. Kipinde chenio Lichanduko lya Bhambo Chapanga likibha ku muche ghu ku Betele. <verse eid="JDG 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 20:28" />Finehase mwana jwa Eliazale, nchokolo jwa Alune akibha mpiya litambiko jwatumika nnonge jhabhe. Akaichilahele ngabhannobholila Finehase ankonye Bhambo Chapanga, “Bho, kabhele tujhende tukabulane na akalongo bhito bha likabila lya aka Benjamine?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 20:28">Bhambo Chapanga ngajhangwila, “Nnyendengane. Kilabho namatenda manhotole bhando bheniya.”<verse eid="JDG 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 20:29" />Yene Akaichilahele ngabhabheka akakomana ngondo muijhobho kutindii bomane jha ku Gebeya. <verse eid="JDG 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 20:30" />Lichiko lyuutato Akaichilahele ngabhajhenda kubulana na bhando bhilikabila lya Akabenjamine. Ngibhikilenganikiya kutindii mubomane jhuku Gebeya ngabhajhema chehemo jhabhe pukutumbula. <verse eid="JDG 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 20:31" />Peniya, bhando bha likabila lya Akabenjamine pibhabhoka ku muche jhuku Gebeya kutumbu kubulana na Akaichilahele, nambo ngabhatilila panja jha muche na akakomana ngondo bha Akabenjamine ngabhakengamila. Ngibhipitii kabhele ngita chibhapitila makacho, Akabenjamine ngabhakoma Akaichilahele mundela ngolongwa jhijhenda ku Betele pamonga nuku Gebeya ade kunjenga. Ngabhakomwa Akaichilahele makome matato. <verse eid="JDG 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 20:32" />Akakomana ngondo bhuku Benjamine ngabhawacha kulonge, “Twabulite ngita makacho.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 20:32">Nambo Akaichilahele ngabhalonge, “Twenga tutile, kupala twautii panja jha muche ade kundela ngolongwa.”<verse eid="JDG 20:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 20:33" />Yene kikunde kikolongwa cha akakomana ngondo bhoha bhuku Akaichilahele ngabhahikita Baale Tamale nu kujhema peniya, ngabhajhema mu chehemo jhabhe kupala kukomana. Kipinde cheche akakomana bhange bhuku Ichilahele bhubhakijhobhite upandi ghulitipikii lyobha mwa Gibeya ngabhapitila kukomana ngondo. <verse eid="JDG 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 20:34" />Akakomana ngondo bhange elufo kome Akaichilahele bhibhamanya kukomana ngondo maha ngabhajhingilila bhando bhuku Gebeya. Ngondo jhi lichiko lyenio ikibha ngolongwa. Nambo Akabenjamine bhakamanyii jhe kubhehe kukomelekelwa kwabhe kubhandikile. <verse eid="JDG 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 20:35" />Bhambo Chapanga ngabheka Akaichilahele kwaotola akakomana ngondo bha Akabenjamine. Akaichilahele ngabhakoma bhando elufo ichiline nunhwano na miya jhimo. Akakomana ngondo bhoha bhibhakomitwe bhakibha mapunde bhukubulana kwa upanga. <verse eid="JDG 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 20:36" />Peniya bhando bhilikabila lya Benjamine ngabhamanya kubhehe bhalepelile.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JDG 20:36">Akaichilahele bhaotola Akabenjamine</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 20:36">Akaichilahele ngabhabhujha unyuma anda bhatenda kwatila bhando bha likabila lya Akabenjamine, ngabhahobholila kubhehe ajhabhe bhibhakibha bhajhobhite kupala kwabula bhando bhuku muche gwa ku Gibeya.<verse eid="JDG 20:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 20:37" />Bhando bhibhajhobhila ngabhabhoka kajhombe nukujhingilii muche ghuku Gebeya na kwakoma bhando bhoha bhibhakibha mwenio ku upanga. <verse eid="JDG 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 20:38" />Akakomana ngondo bhu ku Ichilahele na bhala akakomana ngondo bhibhajhobhite kutindii muche, ngabhalaghina kubheka nginyililo. Bhala bhubhajhobhite ngabhajhita mwotu nkolongwa nu lyohe ngaljhenda kunane ngita lihunde. <verse eid="JDG 20:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 20:39" />Peniya, akakomana ngondo bhuku Ichilahele ngabhaghalambwika nu kwajhingilila akakomana ngondo bha Akabenjamine. Kipinde cheche, bhando bhi likabila lya Benjamine bhakibha bhakomite Akaichilahele makome matato nu kulongolelana, “Twabulite hake ngita pitabula makacho.” <verse eid="JDG 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 20:40" />Nambo lihunde lela lya malyoe pilitumbwila kuuka mu muche gwenio, bhando bha likabila lya Benjamine pibhaghalambwika unyuma nu kukangacha kulola muche gwabhe ukajhaka mwotu. <verse eid="JDG 20:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JDG 20:41" />Ndi Akaichilahele pibhaghalambwika na Akabenjamine ngibhahechwika hake, nhwalo ngabhamanya kubhehe ngohe kujhomwoka kwabhe kuikite. <verse eid="JDG 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JDG 20:42" />Yene ngabhaghalambwika, ngabhabhatilila Akaichilahele kujhenda kunjenga, nambo ngondo ngajhakolela nukikibhona bhabhii pakate jha ikunde ibhele ya akakomana ngondo ya Akaichilahele, na akakomana ngondo bheniya ngabhaikilila nu kwakoma. <verse eid="JDG 20:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JDG 20:43" />Akaichilahele kwapenganikiya kila chehemo Akabenjamine, ngabhakengemila kuhumii mu muche jhuku Noa ade upandi ghulihumii lyobha mwa ku Gebeya kongo kupeta kwakoma bhando pakate jhabhe. <verse eid="JDG 20:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JDG 20:44" />Lichiko lyenio bhando elufo kome na nane bha likabila lya Benjamine, bhoha bhakibha akakomana ngondo bhangajhoghopa, ngabhakomitwa. <verse eid="JDG 20:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JDG 20:45" />Bhando bhange bhalikabila lya Benjamine ngabhaghalambwika nu kutilila kujhenda kunjenga ade mulindalabho lya Limone. Pakate jhabhe bhando elufo nhwano ngabhakomitwa kundela ngolongwa pibhakibha bhatilita. Akaichilahele ngabhajhendilila kwabhengabhenga Akabenjamine kwa makakala ghoha ade mu muche jhuku Gidomu, kwenio ngabhakoma bhando bhange elufo ibhele. <verse eid="JDG 20:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JDG 20:46" />Lichiko lyenio akakomana ngondo elufo ichiline nunhwano bha Akabenjamine bhibhamanye kubulanila mapanga, ngaghakomwa, bhoha bhakibha akakomana ngondo bhakibha mapunde ghukubulana.<verse eid="JDG 20:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JDG 20:47" />Nambo akanalome miya chita gha likabila lya Benjamine ngabhaotola kutilii kunjenga ade panane jha kulindalabhalo lyaku Limone, ngabhatama kwenio myehe ncheche. <verse eid="JDG 20:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JDG 20:48" />Akaichilahele ngabhaghalambwikila kabhele aka Benjamine, ngabhakoma bhoha, akanalome na akakeghe na yana pamonga ni inyama. Ni ilebhe yoha ibhikolila kwenio ngibhijhocha mwotu.<verse eid="JDG 20:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JDG 21" />
  <para style="s">Akakeghe kunhwalo gwa Akabenjamine</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 21:1" />Akaichilahele bhakatei kulapila pibhakibha ku Misipa nnonge jha Bhambo Chapanga kubhehe, “Abhii jhe mundo pakate jhabhe jwapakujheketela mwana mundo mwikeghe antolanikicha nu munalome jwa likabila lya Benjamine.” <verse eid="JDG 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 21:2" />Badala jha ngondo jhenie bhando, ngabhajhenda ade ku Betele, ngabhalelita kwa lipyanda likolongwa palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga ade kimiye. <verse eid="JDG 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 21:3" />Bhalongila, “Mwe ma Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga jwaku Ichilahele, nhwalo ghane kipitii kilebhe chenje? Bho, kilebhe ghane likabila lyaka Benjamine lihobhalile pa Ichilahele pano?”<verse eid="JDG 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 21:4" />Kilabho jhake bhando ngabhajhimwika putepute, ngabhachenga chehemo jhu kupiikiya matambiko gha ghukukomelekeya pamonga na matambiko gha uteeke. <verse eid="JDG 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 21:5" />Peniya Akaichilahele ngabhakonyina, “Bho, pakate jha makabila ghoha gha aka Ichilahele kibhii, kikunde chochoha changaika kukongana pamonga pangongano jhitendika nnonge jha Bhambo Chapanga?” Nhwalo bhakatei kulapii kulonge, mundo jhojhoha anda akotwike kukongana nnonge jha Bhambo Chapanga kwenio ku Misipa, ipalwa akomwa. <verse eid="JDG 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 21:6" />Nambo aka Ichilahele ngabhabhonila kiya akalongomundo bha likabila lya aka Benjamine, ngabhalonge, “Deleno likabila limo lya aka Ichilahele lihobhalile. <verse eid="JDG 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 21:7" />Ngohe natutenda bhole kupala kwapela akakeghe bheniya akanalome bha likabila lya aka Benjamine bhibhaighilile? Nhwalo ngatulapila kwa liina lya Bhambo Chapanga kubhehe twileka jhe yana ito ikeghe itolane na aka Benjamine!”<verse eid="JDG 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 21:8" />Ngabhapala kumanya kubhehe, anda kikibha kikunde chochoha cha likabila lya aka Ichilahele lyangajhenda pangongano nnonge jha Bhambo Chapanga ku Misipa. Ngabhamanya kubhehe akibha jhe mundo kubhoke ku Yabeshi Geleade jwakaika pangongano jhenie. <verse eid="JDG 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 21:9" />Akaichilahele pibhabhalingwa ku Misipa akibha jhe mundo jhojhoha jhuku Yabeshi Geleade jwakaikite pangongano jhenio. <verse eid="JDG 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 21:10" />Yene, aka Ichilahele bhoha ngabhapelika akakomana ngondo bhibhamanya kukomana maha elufo kome niibhele bhibhakibha mapunde bhukukomana, ngabhalaghila kulonge, “Nnyendangane makakome akolo muche bhuku Yebeshi Geleade, akakeghe pamonga na yana yabhe. <verse eid="JDG 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 21:11" />Helahela makakoma akanalome na akakeghe bhoha bhibhawaite kugholoka na munalome.” <verse eid="JDG 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 21:12" />Kwenio ku Yabeshi Geleade ngabhakole akakeghe miya ncheche bhinagholoka jhe na munalome jhojhoha, ngabhapelika pa kighono chabhe ku Shilo mu kilambo chuku Kanaane.<verse eid="JDG 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 21:13" />Peniya, Akaichilahele bhibhakongina kwenio ngabhapelika lilobhe kupala kubhehe teeke kwa bhando bha likabila lya Benjamine bhibhakibha mulindalabho lyaku Limone. <verse eid="JDG 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 21:14" />Akanalome bheniya bha likabila lya Benjamine ngabhabhujhila ajhabhe bheniya kipinde cheche. Bhahe, ngabhakamwiya akakeghe bheniya bhibhapata kukomwa, kwenio ku Yabeshi Geleade. Nambo akakeghe bheniya bhakakwelite jhe.<verse eid="JDG 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 21:15" />Akaichilahele ngabhabhonila kiya bhando bha likabila lya Benjamine, mana Bhambo Chapanga pakaighii pandina kulihobhecha likabila lya Benjamine pakate jha aka Ichilahele. <verse eid="JDG 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 21:16" />Peniya ilongoche bhoha bhibhakibha pangongano jhenio ngabhalonge, “Ngohe natutenda bhole kupala kwapekeya akakeghe, akanalome bhibhapelwii akakeghe mana akakeghe bhoha bha likabila lya Akabenjamine bhakomitwe? <verse eid="JDG 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 21:17" />Ipalwa ngohe, akanalome bhoha bhibhaighilii bha aka Benjamine bhapate akakeghe kupala bhabhelekane, lyangahobhele jhe likabila lyolyoha pa Ichilahele. <verse eid="JDG 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 21:18" />Nambo twatolanikicha jhe yana ito, mana tukalapile kubhehe mundo jhojhoha jwapala kuntolanikicha likabila lya aka Benjamine, mwana gwake mwikeghe abhaha na likoto.”<verse eid="JDG 21:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 21:19" />Bhahe, ngabhakombwika kubheka unyagho jhikumpe ichima Bhambo Chapanga ghutendika kila chaka ku Shilo, muche ghubhii upandi gwa kachikachine jhuku Betele, nuupandi gwa kuchine, kundela ngolongwa jhibhoke ku Betele kujhenda ku Chekemo, ukibha ubhandikile. <verse eid="JDG 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 21:20" />Yene ngabhalaghila akanalome bha Akabenjamine, kulonge, “Nnyendangane makajhobhela mu mighonda jha michabibo. <verse eid="JDG 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 21:21" />Mma miho. Achikabhale bhuku Shilo pibhapata kupeta panja kuina kipinde cha unyagho, mpita mu michabibo na kila mundo antola kamwale abha nhwanamundo. Peniya mmujha mu kilambo chuku Benjamine. <verse eid="JDG 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 21:22" />Akatate bhabhe amu akahacha bhabhe anda abhaikite kutukokolekeya tulongela, ‘Twe natwajhopa makole kiya bhando bhuku Benjamine na maleke akakeghe bheniya bhatole, mana ngondo jhuku Yabeshi Geleade twapatangine jhe achikabhale bhakwape bheniya. Na nhwalo mabhene bhapii jhe achikabhale bhino, mmii jhe ni lilemwa.’ ”<verse eid="JDG 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 21:23" />Bhahe, akanalome bha likabila lya Benjamine ngabhateila yenio, kila mundo ngakiaghulila kamwale pakate jha achikabhale pibhapitita panja kuina, kwenio ku Shilo nu kuntola kubhehe nhwanamundo. Peniya, ngabhabhujha kajhabhe, ngabhachenga chenda yabhe kabhele nu kutama mwenio. <verse eid="JDG 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 21:24" />Machiko ghagha aka Ichilahele ngabhabhoka, kila mundo ngabhujha chehemo pi likabila lyake na akalongo mundo. Kila mundo ngabhujha chehemo jhibhammaghulile kubhehe jhake.<verse eid="JDG 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 21:25" />Kipinde chenie pakibha jhe munahota nkolongwa mu kilambo chuku Ichilahele. Kila mundo ngaoto kuhenga chikipala nu kubhehe tela tugha.<verse eid="JDG 21:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 21" />
</usx>